2018-10-04 23:28:46 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 36695081, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/36695081", "question_id": 20959801, "author_id": "3d198a56310c02c4a83efb9f4a4c027e", "content": "<p>知乎于 2015 年 1 月 7 日上线了「<a href=\"http://www.zhihu.com/community\" class=\"internal\">知乎社区服务中心</a>」（<a href=\"http://www.zhihu.com/community\" class=\"internal\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">zhihu.com/community</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a>），为知乎社区管理事务提供了单独的页面。用户可以在知乎网页的首页右侧找到「社区服务中心」。每位知乎用户均可在问题、回答、评论、私信、收藏夹、文章、个人页面以及问题编辑日志找到「举报」按钮，举报「广告等垃圾内容」、「<a href=\"http://www.zhihu.com/question/20239684\" class=\"internal\">不友善内容</a>」、「违法违规内容」及「恶意行为」。</p><p><br></p><p>举报后的内容将由知乎社区管理团队依据《<a href=\"http://www.zhihu.com/question/19790711\" class=\"internal\">知乎社区管理规定</a>》对举报的内容进行处理。举报内容被处理后，举报者将收到含有处理结果的私信通知，并且随时可以从首页右侧进入「社区服务中心」查看自己的举报处理进度和过往的违规记录。</p><p><br></p><p><b>如何使用举报功能</b></p><p><br></p><p>举报按钮的位置分别位于：</p><ul><li>举报问题</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/c828fabb230a5a3b5899e55ac14024e6_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"858\" data-rawheight=\"234\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"858\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/c828fabb230a5a3b5899e55ac14024e6_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='858'%20height='234'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"858\" data-rawheight=\"234\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"858\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/c828fabb230a5a3b5899e55ac14024e6_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/c828fabb230a5a3b5899e55ac14024e6_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><ul><li>举报回答</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/98a3a85e85ec1e1b9610f50b19e72d12_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"873\" data-rawheight=\"447\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"873\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/98a3a85e85ec1e1b9610f50b19e72d12_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='873'%20height='447'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"873\" data-rawheight=\"447\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"873\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/98a3a85e85ec1e1b9610f50b19e72d12_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/98a3a85e85ec1e1b9610f50b19e72d12_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><ul><li>举报评论</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/2dee599d41148e8ffd9e0ea2d77ed3e4_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"762\" data-rawheight=\"264\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"762\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/2dee599d41148e8ffd9e0ea2d77ed3e4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='762'%20height='264'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"762\" data-rawheight=\"264\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"762\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/2dee599d41148e8ffd9e0ea2d77ed3e4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/2dee599d41148e8ffd9e0ea2d77ed3e4_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><ul><li>举报私信</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/00e05717c5e6675a1cc09ff6bf56657c_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"847\" data-rawheight=\"119\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"847\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/00e05717c5e6675a1cc09ff6bf56657c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='847'%20height='119'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"847\" data-rawheight=\"119\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"847\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/00e05717c5e6675a1cc09ff6bf56657c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/00e05717c5e6675a1cc09ff6bf56657c_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><ul><li>举报收藏夹</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/d126306c76b63c9af524878b4f2d79ad_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"991\" d