\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><ul><li>举报问题编辑日志</li></ul><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/479a947eabd089e1247106cd127b32ee_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"814\" data-rawheight=\"281\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"814\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/479a947eabd089e1247106cd127b32ee_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='814'%20height='281'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"814\" data-rawheight=\"281\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"814\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/479a947eabd089e1247106cd127b32ee_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/479a947eabd089e1247106cd127b32ee_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>举报编辑日志是此次新增的功能。如果你发现有人通过编辑日志发广告，或者进行编辑战，请积极举报吧！</p><p><br></p><p>如果你有任何建议或意见，欢迎私信联系 <a class=\"member_mention\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/3d198a56310c02c4a83efb9f4a4c027e\" data-hash=\"3d198a56310c02c4a83efb9f4a4c027e\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$3d198a56310c02c4a83efb9f4a4c027e\">@知乎小管家</a> 进行反馈。</p>", "praise_num": 135, "comments_num": 161, "create_time": "2015-01-07T18:11:08", "update_time": "2017-09-20T19:06:57", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:28:46.871734"}
