2018-10-04 23:29:46 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/482519349 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/482519349 [status:201 request:0.062s]
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 482519349, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/482519349", "question_id": 290735159, "author_id": "d4c05935265ff6f349d3e2a2db196c25", "content": "<p>Offer属于单向合同，允许应聘者违约但是如果企业违约是要承担责任的，除非双方协商一致，只要你去报到公司是没有理由拒绝你的。</p><p>一般来说企业招聘某个岗位存在招聘1人，或者招聘多人的情况。如果招聘多人公司继续挂着招聘信息很正常，即时招聘1人也会存在挂着招聘信息的情况，分析如下：</p><ul><li>害怕收到Offer的应聘者不来报到</li><li>工作疏忽导致没有及时下架</li><li>此岗位比较重要，属于需要持续关注和招聘的岗位</li></ul>", "praise_num": 11, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-31T14:50:10", "update_time": "2018-08-31T14:50:10", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:46.246745"}
