2018-10-04 23:29:46 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 491357224, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/491357224", "question_id": 290735159, "author_id": "f39285a7a299e3ef728ec17f207f24bb", "content": "庸人自扰之，<br><br>是之前发布的广告，肯定不会那么快撤销的！<br><br>也或者有2个需求吧，——不确定的就不要猜测，若的确有疑问直接问就好了 。。<br><br><p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//t.zsxq.com/zbYRr7u\" class=\" external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">t.zsxq.com/zbYRr7u</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> (二维码自动识别)</p><br><p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//weixin.qq.com/r/YDvdxe-E4rKdraum925y\" class=\" external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://</span><span class=\"visible\">weixin.qq.com/r/YDvdxe-</span><span class=\"invisible\">E4rKdraum925y</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a> (二维码自动识别)</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-14T12:53:20", "update_time": "2018-09-14T12:53:26", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:46.400145"}
