 'update_time': 1535117218,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/477140256',
 'zhihu_id': 477140256}
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/475835486 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/475835486 [status:201 request:0.060s]
2018-10-04 23:29:46 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 475835486, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/475835486", "question_id": 290735159, "author_id": "87ca8f2b38c921c37347eb98bd58333e", "content": "<p>企业招聘信息是HR统一放上去的，我们指导成功案例1200多，其中也有很多小伙伴在拿到offer没入职前就被顶掉了，给到的反馈信息是项目有变，暂时停止招聘该岗位或者是部门重新调整等原因。还有很多大厂明明不招该岗位了，岗位依然挂在招聘栏。你这种情况就是还没入职，HR的工作职责还没真正完成，必须用人部门需求人才岗位到岗，培训合格上岗后，才下架</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-08-23T11:23:56", "update_time": "2018-08-23T11:23:56", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:46.616564"}
