2018-10-04 23:29:49 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494833323 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:29:49 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494833323 [status:201 request:0.060s]
2018-10-04 23:29:49 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494833323, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494833323", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "bd4e5f863765f01819409d640e6258eb", "content": "<p>进学生会的有2种人，有能力和没能力的。</p><p>出学生会的只有一种人----有能力的。</p><p>谁像和一群猪在一起，还要帮猪干活。</p>", "praise_num": 7, "comments_num": 4, "create_time": "2018-09-20T01:19:19", "update_time": "2018-09-20T01:19:19", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:49.079418"}
