2018-10-04 23:29:49 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 490005556, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/490005556", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "8a7296fdba6433b5468233d13eea3087", "content": "你知道吗？资本是第二权力。<br>那你知道第一权力是什么？是暴力。<br>敢在沙漠这种现代秩序完全失效的地方卖打劫钱，看的出来你的天灵盖很硬啊！", "praise_num": 3327, "comments_num": 138, "create_time": "2018-09-12T10:39:55", "update_time": "2018-09-12T10:39:55", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:49.678889"}
