2018-10-04 23:29:50 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494047152 [status:201 request:0.115s]
2018-10-04 23:29:50 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494047152, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494047152", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "4fa22629be0e2ee2069c8c4d65ac2eab", "content": "<p>从长远利益来说，一人一瓶免费送，我相信马云活着出去不会亏待他的救命恩人。另一位属于维稳费用，保证他不会拼命来抢水。</p>", "praise_num": 290, "comments_num": 36, "create_time": "2018-09-18T20:56:48", "update_time": "2018-09-18T20:56:48", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:50.095438"}
