2018-10-04 23:29:50 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:29:50 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/493853648 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:29:50 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/493853648 [status:201 request:0.065s]
2018-10-04 23:29:50 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 493853648, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/493853648", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "2929c0c75d8d742cc9333b507145bf39", "content": "<p>马列的经济理论证明了“价值决定价格”，而非西经所认为的“供求决定价格”。</p><p><br></p><p>因为卖水的会被打死。</p><p><br></p><p>一方存在生命危险时不存在市场，这假设等同于“拦路抢劫後，劫匪赠送鲜花给受害人”。</p>", "praise_num": 163, "comments_num": 37, "create_time": "2018-09-18T15:34:24", "update_time": "2018-09-18T15:34:24", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:50.828284"}
