2018-10-04 23:29:51 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:29:51 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494990284 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:29:51 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494990284 [status:201 request:0.125s]
2018-10-04 23:29:51 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494990284, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494990284", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "f7014b21c9174fc64aab4ffd048eb1c1", "content": "<p>政治规则第一——暴力决定最终分配。</p><p>这里没有市场，你就一个人？还想讨价还价？为什么我要跟你讨价还价？跟马云商量下，我直击面门，马云打后脑勺。妥妥地把你办了。你想卖的水没了，你自己的水也没了。这下我跟马云的水都够用了。</p><p>然后，弄醒你，问你现在这瓶水就是你的命，你愿意花多少钱来买。多少钱我也不卖，等着变木乃伊吧！或许我们出来后会对你人道主义救援。不过现在？对不住了。</p><p></p>", "praise_num": 15, "comments_num": 2, "create_time": "2018-09-20T11:10:42", "update_time": "2018-09-20T11:34:30", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:51.448407"}
