2018-10-04 23:29:53 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 495696262, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/495696262", "question_id": 65875449, "author_id": "0", "content": "<p>A1 9800 10000 10200</p><p>小s 三分 13200</p><p>9.28</p><p>下午cooler应该发信，静待佳音</p><p>看到无秘一些三分员工撕一分二分员工，我真是无语。大家都是打工者，都是被剥削群体，互相撕有什么意义吗，也不知道是不是一些内部或外部人员去带的节奏。不论今年最后的结果如何，都希望我的同事cpa通过，身体健康，但也不要因为薪水问题丧的无心复习不愿工作，毕竟除了眼前的苟且，还有诗与远方。共勉。</p><p>9.27</p><p>传言十三薪改十二薪，无秘普华区一片哀嚎 boom </p><p>德勤工资也涨了，来源无秘</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-727ea1715285cc3f636797b2cb2435a2_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"776\" data-rawheight=\"45\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"776\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-727ea1715285cc3f636797b2cb2435a2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='776'%20height='45'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"776\" data-rawheight=\"45\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"776\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-727ea1715285cc3f636797b2cb2435a2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-727ea1715285cc3f636797b2cb2435a2_b.jpg\"></figure><p>—————————</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"2079\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='960'%20height='2079'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"2079\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ea47abcdd1ac4ebc7d4c8dfffa0eb32c_b.jpg\"></figure><p>讲真 看了今年kp的b1 b2涨薪，我觉得我以前不该黑老6，话说我司想当game changer 起码得先把薪水涨上来吧，要是今年s还冻薪，真心觉的不如其他三家了…top1总不能是靠名字的长度得来的吧</p><p><br></p><p>—————————</p><p>9.26更新</p><p>今天开沟通会 不知道有没有转机</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"719\" data-rawheight=\"559\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"719\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='719'%20height='559'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"719\" data-rawheight=\"559\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"719\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b743eac7ff17708b9c490bf5d059e19_b.jpg\"></figure><p></p>", "praise_num": 63, "comments_num": 38, "create_time": "2018-09-21T13:08:32", "update_time": "2018-09-28T15:20:21", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:29:53.050432"}
