2018-10-04 23:30:17 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494883684, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494883684", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "c6fd8f4370f4c3aa29e9ab20d1338e19", "content": "<p>不要钱。</p><p>不反对你赚人命钱，但也别嘲笑不屑于赚人命钱的人。</p>", "praise_num": 13, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T08:13:15", "update_time": "2018-09-20T08:16:42", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:17.028176"}
