2018-10-04 23:30:17 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494876600, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494876600", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "d201cd60c3acd22d51e22e67fa442100", "content": "<p>500亿一瓶，今日特惠，买一瓶送一瓶。</p><p>机会难得，切勿错过。</p>", "praise_num": 17, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T07:49:03", "update_time": "2018-09-20T07:49:03", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:17.101313"}
