2018-10-04 23:30:17 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494734540, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494734540", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "e9e83e422e93d2cfdad8c03c2730abe8", "content": "<p>emmm，超过半数的回答违法了，也高估了所谓送水所能带来的人情利益。</p><p>------------------------------------------</p><p>同样的水，卖给题主和马云收费差巨大。（违《中华人民共和国价格法》）</p><p>用水换取马云巨额资产的的合同（保证书），特别是还有渴死题主儆马云这种操作的。</p><p>（违《中华人民共和国合同法》、《中华人民共和国价格法》）</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>《中华人民共和国价格法》第十四条第七款规定：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-526760a6ce8852c21b82ee910ef8a121_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1138\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9ad8911c5feeb961612291198bdee3a6_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-526760a6ce8852c21b82ee910ef8a121_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1138'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1138\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9ad8911c5feeb961612291198bdee3a6_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-526760a6ce8852c21b82ee910ef8a121_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-526760a6ce8852c21b82ee910ef8a121_b.jpg\"></figure><p>第七款中的法律法规指1995年经国务院批准，国家计委发布实施了《制止牟取暴利的暂行规定》。</p><p>其第五条第二款规定</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-02db661f44a59f8f1be3d314badb7831_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"707\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ff53c21418f140f7793fbcdeec3b0cd8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-02db661f44a59f8f1be3d314badb7831_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='707'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"707\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ff53c21418f140f7793fbcdeec3b0cd8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-02db661f44a59f8f1be3d314badb7831_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-02db661f44a59f8f1be3d314badb7831_b.jpg\"></figure><p>第八条第四款规定：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c9c36c5ed3154786f5401d8f2a6f5072_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"684\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-087a95adafd523c60682cde027ecd171_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c9c36c5ed3154786f5401d8f2a6f5072_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='684'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"684\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-087a95adafd523c60682cde027ecd171_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c9c36c5ed3154786f5401d8f2a6f5072_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c9c36c5ed3154786f5401d8f2a6f5072_b.jpg\"></figure><p>《中华人民共和国合同法》第五十二规定：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5ca62d96659c90e947f6ee1fa205704d_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"555\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-49772025829cbe3b60686c1648830367_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5ca62d96659c90e947f6ee1fa205704d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='555'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"555\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-49772025829cbe3b60686c1648830367_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5ca62d96659c90e947f6ee1fa205704d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5ca62d96659c90e947f6ee1fa205704d_b.jpg\"></figure><p>第五十四条规定</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-252dbf902b95938cebd57c339d6f601f_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"618\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7f8bad26a7c6d1db0c28beb51fab1764_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-252dbf902b95938cebd57c339d6f601f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='618'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"618\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7f8bad26a7c6d1db0c28beb51fab1764_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-252dbf902b95938cebd57c339d6f601f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-252dbf902b95938cebd57c339d6f601f_b.jpg\"></figure><p>-------------------------------------------</p><p>至于人情利益，看看知乎诸位以为救完马云之后所能得到的东西，</p><p>要是马云能轻易决定大笔财产的动向，阿里的继承人咋就不是他儿子呢？</p><p>嘿嘿嘿，我就不用水滋醒你们了</p><p><br></p><p>综上，</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>马云什么时候进沙漠</p><p>卖水组队（1/100）</p>", "praise_num": 9, "comments_num": 6, "create_time": "2018-09-19T22:08:25", "update_time": "2018-09-19T23:32:06", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:17.611916"}
