2018-10-04 23:30:18 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/65875449/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=20&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': '7a11d52a2d90f8e4e6c47efbf966d70e',
 'comments_num': 7,
 'content': '<p>弱弱的问一句9600是起薪吗？正常发展的话工资是怎么样的提升速度啊？</p><p>我是一个专科毕业的在工地上当施工员觉得这个工作太危险时间又特别长。想干别的但是在网上了解了一下。</p><p>发现很多行业即使是好大学毕业的也工资不高。起薪都是两三千，这还是上了四年大好学而且比较努力并且在以后的工作中也需要不断学习。</p><p>可是在建筑行业，好像不需要怎么努力。就按部就班的像我这样工作56年也就可以上万了。</p><p>我不是一个努力的人，也比较笨。感觉其他的行业升工资好困难啊。</p><p>是我又不想去工地，在工地上已经得了腰间盘突出和半月板撕裂。也特别危险。</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 30, 18, 64912),
 'create_time': 1538101624,
 'praise_num': 4,
 'question_id': 65875449,
 'update_time': 1538101624,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/499741734',
 'zhihu_id': 499741734}
