2018-10-04 23:30:18 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:30:18 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/499810420 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:30:18 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/499810420 [status:201 request:0.062s]
2018-10-04 23:30:18 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 499810420, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/499810420", "question_id": 65875449, "author_id": "0", "content": "<p>我还是先来恶心下其他三大吧…</p><p>听说你们去年涨不少、破厕所冻薪了？</p><p>不好意思冻薪也比你们收入高</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"842\" data-rawheight=\"231\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"842\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='842'%20height='231'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"842\" data-rawheight=\"231\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"842\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-97c7bdad64396b3000d14aff7bb8f85a_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>算一波年收入，以S2为例</p><p>DTT年收入（FY19调整后），不同评级的年收入如下</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5724268fd62c77daa8b24c6a4d8bc95f_b.png\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"622\" data-rawheight=\"96\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"622\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5724268fd62c77daa8b24c6a4d8bc95f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='622'%20height='96'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"622\" data-rawheight=\"96\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"622\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5724268fd62c77daa8b24c6a4d8bc95f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5724268fd62c77daa8b24c6a4d8bc95f_b.png\"></figure><p>PwC年收入（以FY18的base作为基数，假设1分、2分、3分对应的bonus基数分别是1.0、1.3、1.5）</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"733\" data-rawheight=\"201\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"733\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='733'%20height='201'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"733\" data-rawheight=\"201\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"733\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1322de4e12782b86198af02be972c2c8_b.jpg\"></figure><p>总结：</p><p>对于3分（average）的S2来说，今年base要涨850元，才能与DTT持平</p><p>对于2分（High），今年要涨630元，才能与DTT持平</p><p>对于1分（Top），按照FY18的收入水平，降薪208元可以与FY19的DTT持平</p><p>所以就是评分越高、与其他四大差距越小、甚至会更高（是否最高？）</p><p>坐等下午eTRS</p>", "praise_num": 6, "comments_num": 14, "create_time": "2018-09-28T11:50:07", "update_time": "2018-09-28T12:38:36", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:18.722965"}
