2018-10-04 23:30:29 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 488663161, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/488663161", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "aabd306ee188672706687c374b6711e4", "content": "<p>这个在道德经原文中就给出答案了。为无为，事无事，味无味，大小多少。首先就不能给自己一个无法达成的目标来哄骗自己竭尽全力走向歧途。</p>", "praise_num": 3, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-10T08:25:43", "update_time": "2018-09-10T08:25:43", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:29.708559"}
