 'zhihu_id': 472822364}
2018-10-04 23:30:32 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:30:32 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/281899396 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:30:32 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/281899396 [status:201 request:0.080s]
2018-10-04 23:30:32 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 281899396, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281899396", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "c17e0d2cfca5316031bb346dcd702800", "content": "<p>不是引进负面而是因为懒，导致阅读极其困难。就例如中文虽然引进了喷气式飞机和直升机这两个概念，但是是以符合中文语法的方式表达，而不是像现在日本的做法那样原封不动地翻译成“杰特爱尔夸夫特（jet aircraft）”和“海里卡普特（helicopter）”只有极少数的难以找到对应表示方式的词汇，例如chocolate才是用音译的。</p><p>至于为什么盲目用外来语不好，我也不欺负题主可能不熟悉英文了，我jiuzheyang用hanyu拼音来跟tizhu解释，现在nizhidao看着you多danteng了吧？</p>", "praise_num": 171, "comments_num": 46, "create_time": "2017-12-24T01:21:03", "update_time": "2017-12-24T01:21:04", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:32.609753"}
