2018-10-04 23:30:32 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 463630827, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/463630827", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "96479e64f5cbbec5139bdc2d60e30351", "content": "<p>我是來推薦一本書的：「それっ! 日本語で言えばいいのに!!」（那個明明可以用和語説的吖）</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b36d24089dd0103a05832efa59050f13_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"360\" data-rawheight=\"535\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7c8725bb57bb10952dff2050067770b6_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"360\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='360'%20height='535'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"360\" data-rawheight=\"535\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7c8725bb57bb10952dff2050067770b6_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"360\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b36d24089dd0103a05832efa59050f13_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>以及日本人自己正在做的亊：</p><p>「外来語」言い換え提案</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%25E3%2580%258C%25E5%25A4%2596%25E6%259D%25A5%25E8%25AA%259E%25E3%2580%258D%25E8%25A8%2580%25E3%2581%2584%25E6%258F%259B%25E3%2581%2588%25E6%258F%2590%25E6%25A1%2588\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" class=\" external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%</span><span class=\"invisible\">E3%80%8C%E5%A4%96%E6%9D%A5%E8%AA%9E%E3%80%8D%E8%A8%80%E3%81%84%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%88%E6%8F%90%E6%A1%88</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85a9e7f6dcf5076e1bbf428ae8a61c63_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"340\" data-rawheight=\"340\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8a08bdaa07749ce61fbe43987c1443f3_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"340\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='340'%20height='340'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"340\" data-rawheight=\"340\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8a08bdaa07749ce61fbe43987c1443f3_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"340\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85a9e7f6dcf5076e1bbf428ae8a61c63_b.jpg\"></figure><p></p>", "praise_num": 7, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-08-08T13:52:52", "update_time": "2018-08-24T16:04:37", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:32.754669"}
