2018-10-04 23:30:33 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 391748723, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/391748723", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "dc838f8b49332033122a5115282ab3eb", "content": "<p></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"318\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='318'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"318\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-852a51d8e97caff2fc129dc4c4cae52c_b.jpg\"></figure><p>那个，我其实想说的是，俺们大神内最怕遇到头疼的病人，尤其是有点疼的更是大忌。说实话，年轻人我都建议做核磁（话说还要加mrv），不做的签字，遇到蛋疼无比的静脉窦血栓就玩残了，不管是自己还是病人。。要是中年人和老年人，我都建议做脑ct，毕竟花式出血对于我们这种乡下野狐禅神内可是职业生涯的大忌，分分钟被套路了。。。</p><p><br></p><p>所以你看，我也是看人下菜啊，来了就核磁反而容易玩死自己的职业生涯。</p><p>另外，题主，你误会了核磁了，它没你担心的那种辐射，ct有。。。因为，你看下核磁的英文原文，你告诉哪个是核？！</p>", "praise_num": 104, "comments_num": 33, "create_time": "2018-05-14T23:46:02", "update_time": "2018-05-14T23:46:02", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:33.528838"}
