2018-10-04 23:30:33 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:30:33 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/479593391 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:30:33 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/479593391 [status:201 request:0.079s]
2018-10-04 23:30:33 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 479593391, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/479593391", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "9a0a7dc90380c8236895061c54f62c12", "content": "<p>这事要分开说，是否存在滥用检查，答案是肯定的，</p><p>但是，并不是所有你觉得是滥用检查的检查就真的是滥用检查。（绕口令十级）</p><p>病人要做的是：</p><p>1，期望医生、医院提高医德，救人为本。</p><p>2，积极配合医生，不要用你的常识去挑战医院的学术专业。否则吃亏的是你自己。</p><p></p>", "praise_num": 5, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-27T23:12:38", "update_time": "2018-08-27T23:12:38", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:33.607907"}
