2018-10-04 23:30:33 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 388777827, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/388777827", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "691407ff79e0e91d2db3512595544b9e", "content": "谢邀！医生听到您说的“这几天吃东西，喝水的时候下咽到胸口处总觉得有点儿堵”的症状时，应该为您做胃镜来排除食道肿物的早期表现。", "praise_num": 30, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-05-11T11:39:41", "update_time": "2018-05-11T11:39:41", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:33.772654"}
