2018-10-04 23:30:35 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 495090397, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/495090397", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "4ab2e621ce329b0bd6f0a51576cb0c79", "content": "<p>学生应该以学习为主，学生会的官僚主义多严重我想读过大学的朋友都清楚。</p><p>我想我大学时参加学生会唯一有用的，就是知道了这一点。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T13:54:21", "update_time": "2018-09-20T13:54:21", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:35.874952"}
