2018-10-04 23:30:36 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 495038526, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/495038526", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "99542906acdd981f2c5c4a66e34fa03a", "content": "<p>很有必要，但锻炼效果有限，有些人上到职场还懵懂，先进社团面试，笔试，这些流程可以驾轻就熟，是好事。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T12:26:31", "update_time": "2018-09-20T12:26:31", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:36.011164"}
