2018-10-04 23:30:36 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494967491, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494967491", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "33b1d7f0d634110c4b9181f597923830", "content": "<p>目前</p><p>在我们学校我觉得学生会特别黑暗</p><p>但是很多学生会还是特别能够锻炼人的</p><p>但是学生会里总是会有几个恶心的学姐学长</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T10:39:01", "update_time": "2018-09-20T10:39:01", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:36.147365"}
