2018-10-04 23:30:40 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:30:40 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494516804 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:30:40 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494516804 [status:201 request:0.080s]
2018-10-04 23:30:40 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494516804, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494516804", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "904163d693e2ff2b4988a7294750226a", "content": "<p>不论我开价多少，你俩当时身上的钱估计都不能满足我，话说当时马云承诺500亿我就能拿到500亿？</p><p>试想一下，如果你都快渴死了，对面一个人有水，但是非要你给现钱才能让你喝，你会怎么做？讲道理？</p><p>所以，我会免费给你俩喝水，然后大家一起走出沙漠，或许出去后题主和马老板会想到报恩或者想不到，无所谓，毕竟只剩下两瓶水了。</p>", "praise_num": 4, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T15:44:46", "update_time": "2018-09-19T15:44:46", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:40.594378"}
