2018-10-04 23:30:44 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 334119394, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/334119394", "question_id": 63972880, "author_id": "d01794eea30b2114bf4bdb5e8418e081", "content": "<p>批了，回家了。</p><p>钱少，舒服。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-03-05T00:26:00", "update_time": "2018-03-05T00:26:01", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:30:44.389846"}
