2018-10-04 23:31:01 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 391463224, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/391463224", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "8de4328b3c8d4df94e49b4f6b74c748e", "content": "这种主诉，无诱因吞咽异物感，不考虑食道癌可能的内科大夫都不合格，题主你还是省省吧，找认同感百度贴吧虎扑天涯", "praise_num": 416, "comments_num": 14, "create_time": "2018-05-14T17:12:22", "update_time": "2018-05-14T17:12:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:01.023967"}
