2018-10-04 23:31:01 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:01 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/476604861 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:01 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/476604861 [status:201 request:0.077s]
2018-10-04 23:31:01 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 476604861, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/476604861", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "2db631eb39021775a815bd9c8296dd0c", "content": "说实话，像您这样天赋异禀，机敏伶俐，自学能力强的人，确实不该去医院看病。<br>临床医生都做不到这么自信，太牛了！", "praise_num": 121, "comments_num": 3, "create_time": "2018-08-24T09:48:09", "update_time": "2018-08-24T09:48:09", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:01.218591"}
