2018-10-04 23:31:01 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 389350093, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/389350093", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "50bbb92c8978c6a18606691753c1e18d", "content": "<figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bffe286009372e4a083be3f138741c94_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1532\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b33145cc1912a8ca356e073fe3f258d_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1532\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bffe286009372e4a083be3f138741c94_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1532'%20height='2048'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1532\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4b33145cc1912a8ca356e073fe3f258d_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1532\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bffe286009372e4a083be3f138741c94_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bffe286009372e4a083be3f138741c94_b.jpg\"></figure><p>？？为什么和我们主任说的不一样。。。。主任说国外50岁的人都是常规做一次胃镜肠镜判断有没有息肉。。然后切掉预防变癌。。。为什么你这里变成严重了才用了。。。。。课本说进食哽咽感可能是食管癌的早起表现。。。。根据中国人要拖到蛮严重才去医院的来看。。。。排查个胃镜不过分。。。</p>", "praise_num": 213, "comments_num": 26, "create_time": "2018-05-12T00:04:42", "update_time": "2018-05-12T00:14:07", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:01.611796"}
