2018-10-04 23:31:02 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/470663540 [status:201 request:0.054s]
2018-10-04 23:31:02 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 470663540, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/470663540", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "50d9b56986625c6b7075693c901d5db5", "content": "<p>人家好歹考得上医学院，</p><p>读了五年医科，</p><p>甚至读到硕士博士。</p><p><br></p><p>都不谈有多少年的接诊经验。</p><p><br></p><p>跟这位医生比起来，</p><p>你一个民科还有脸来提问。</p><p><br></p><p>简直气不打一出来。</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "praise_num": 16, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-16T19:34:29", "update_time": "2018-08-16T19:34:29", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:02.101446"}
