2018-10-04 23:31:02 [scrapy.core.engine] DEBUG: Crawled (200) <GET https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/295267316/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22> (referer: https://www.zhihu.com/)
2018-10-04 23:31:02 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:02 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494930446 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:02 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494930446 [status:201 request:0.040s]
2018-10-04 23:31:02 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494930446, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494930446", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "253dc26c4ea6b3a4ddfcc53935763e58", "content": "<p>首先，我们要肯定压力面试、无压力面试、无领导小组等一系列面试模式的作用，可以在不同情况下看到不同人的表现。</p><p>但是，我也要说一句使用压力面试的公司大多都是刻板僵化的公司，不利于营造活跃的企业文化。所以现在很多学生会都采用的是无领导小组，可以更好地看清楚不同人的性格特质，实现人岗匹配。</p><p>压力面试其实就是官僚化的象征，出现在校园肯定不合适。虽然我们都知道学生会就是一群平时琐事不断、出了事背锅的角色，领导们和学生会干部都希望通过压力面试选出一堆听话抗压的角色，但我想这和学生会的宗旨不符。</p><p>学生会，应该是服务于学生的，而不是服务于领导的，应该是学校和学生之间的粘合剂，而不是校领导的棍棒。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T09:42:45", "update_time": "2018-09-20T09:42:45", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:02.781788"}
