2018-10-04 23:31:03 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:03 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494874384 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:03 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494874384 [status:201 request:0.055s]
2018-10-04 23:31:03 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494874384, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494874384", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "d9929235e8b3625db58872eb177f084e", "content": "<p>学生对社会有误解很正常。</p><p>其实到了社会上，真正有本事的人或公司大多是平易近人的，只看你的本事，专业。那些咄咄逼人的面试，是因为公司找不到自己招聘和发展的方向，漫无目的的逼迫应聘者放弃而已。</p><p>找工作不要着急，一定要为自己考虑，不要被媒体的宣传吓着。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-20T07:40:37", "update_time": "2018-09-20T07:40:37", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:03.107729"}
