2018-10-04 23:31:04 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/295267316/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': 'e78032f778b5836e57583cc5f47fd522',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '<p>理论上来说是有用的，但是实际操作意义不大。</p><p>重点不在于面试方法，而在于面试双方的认知。</p><p>部分工作两三年专职HR都未必能够灵活掌握面试方法，学生会面试一年才几次？一年才面多少人？</p><p>并不是所有人拿到武林秘籍都可以学的好，更别提学的又快又好了。</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 31, 3, 903002),
 'create_time': 1537364190,
 'praise_num': 0,
 'question_id': 295267316,
 'update_time': 1537364190,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494717581',
 'zhihu_id': 494717581}
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494716899 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494716899 [status:201 request:0.059s]
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494716899, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494716899", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "344f0e9d8e3643fcec4c324ec47b7821", "content": "<p>即使在职场上，真正有用的压力面试也仅存在于一些规模较大的公司。</p><p>而且在职场应聘过程中，因为压力面试导致的不愉快，包括面试官被应聘者骂之类的，也是很正常的。</p><p><br></p><p>公司实力越差，越容易出现不愉快。</p><p>这基本上是两方面决定的。对于公司方，实力越大，hr更加专业，在压力面试的掌控上也更加老道；对于应聘者，因为期望进入该公司的意愿强烈，所以准备的更加充分，心理有预期的备战。</p><p><br></p><p>而学生会照葫芦画漏勺，第一，早上一年大学的所谓“学长学姐”并没有多么优秀的人际交往技巧，更谈不上对于压力面试的掌控；第二，新生来学生会完全是出于自我满足的，而不是来找不自在的，对于加入学生会这件事大部分人并没有很强的心理预期。</p><p><br></p><p>其实这些人也就是欺负新生刚入学还带着高中的奴性就随便欺负人，现在校招的hr都很少搞这种东西，<b>因为真的会挨打</b></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-31dfee0919e19b7a9ea03221b2dfe48e_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"186\" data-rawheight=\"198\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"186\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='186'%20height='198'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"186\" data-rawheight=\"198\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"186\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-31dfee0919e19b7a9ea03221b2dfe48e_b.jpg\"></figure><p></p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 2, "create_time": "2018-09-19T21:35:23", "update_time": "2018-09-19T21:35:30", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:04.068966"}
