2018-10-04 23:31:04 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494650859 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494650859 [status:201 request:0.040s]
2018-10-04 23:31:04 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494650859, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494650859", "question_id": 295267316, "author_id": "434e58667e5cfa436f6f4071d4b36ccb", "content": "<p>有意义也没有意义，有意义是对社团来说的，简单做个筛选，从一群人里选表现比较好的一部分，没有意义是对部员来说的，除了让你稍微感受一下气氛以外，没什么大的意义，其实很多社团在压力面试之前基本都已经有人选了，压力面试只是个形式，形式大于实际意义。</p><p>还有就是，现在很多大学社团招人越来越难了，搞压力面试多走几轮啥的会无形劝退好多人的。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T19:25:40", "update_time": "2018-09-19T19:25:40", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:04.182323"}
