2018-10-04 23:31:05 [scrapy.core.engine] DEBUG: Crawled (200) <GET https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/293366890/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22> (referer: https://www.zhihu.com/)
2018-10-04 23:31:05 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:05 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494698383 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:05 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494698383 [status:201 request:0.116s]
2018-10-04 23:31:05 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494698383, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494698383", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "9764e7bf27b26c82b310e1e481faa1cd", "content": "<p>你对价值的几种理论都介绍了。那也就不用科普这些理论了。只对你介绍的情况，进行定价策略。</p><p>前提：世界上只有两瓶水可交换。其他水因为某些不可抗拒因素不能用于交换。如不然，人类都将灭绝，定价策略也没有意义。</p><p>目的：寻求利益最大化。做生意也不是做慈善。</p><p>情况：两人要水但支付能力不同。富者亿元一瓶，贫者千元一瓶。</p><p>定价策略：500亿卖一瓶。剩下的一瓶不卖。因为它成为世界上唯一一瓶可交易的水。无价！</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T20:59:43", "update_time": "2018-09-19T20:59:43", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:05.709756"}
