2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/493850896 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/493850896 [status:201 request:0.062s]
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 493850896, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/493850896", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "67f9e14548ae31e04dfc101299f6b283", "content": "如果钱是在答应之后瞬间到账，那就按最高出价把两瓶水卖给马云。反正他们已经快渴死了，想从吃饱喝足精力充沛的我这强行抢水，不存在的。<br>如果钱是出沙漠之后转账，那象征性地保本就够了。在这种紧急情况下，马云赖账外界也不会说什么，所以你卖得再高也没用，马云可以不给。至于题主，卖给你会亏本，不考虑。", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-18T15:30:12", "update_time": "2018-09-19T20:49:44", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:06.528753"}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"493850896","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/293366890/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': '67f9e14548ae31e04dfc101299f6b283',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '如果钱是在答应之后瞬间到账，那就按最高出价把两瓶水卖给马云。反正他们已经快渴死了，想从吃饱喝足精力充沛的我这强行抢水，不存在的。<br>如果钱是出沙漠之后转账，那象征性地保本就够了。在这种紧急情况下，马云赖账外界也不会说什么，所以你卖得再高也没用，马云可以不给。至于题主，卖给你会亏本，不考虑。',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 31, 6, 528753),
 'create_time': 1537255812,
 'praise_num': 2,
 'question_id': 293366890,
 'update_time': 1537361384,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/493850896',
 'zhihu_id': 493850896}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/485324851 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/485324851 [status:201 request:0.061s]
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 485324851, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/485324851", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "e106399e0c5eacf17381b7e084fe97d2", "content": "<p>我送给马云一瓶。</p><p>或者，身上带着多少现金就给多少钱。</p><p>你去沙漠随身带着纸笔写欠条吗？</p><p>马云可以在渴死之前调动500亿？</p><p>什么，你说支付宝转账？</p><p>带着手机还有网络，马云要你救？</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-04T18:35:17", "update_time": "2018-09-04T18:39:10", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:06.592784"}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"485324851","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/293366890/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': 'e106399e0c5eacf17381b7e084fe97d2',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '<p>我送给马云一瓶。</p><p>或者，身上带着多少现金就给多少钱。</p><p>你去沙漠随身带着纸笔写欠条吗？</p><p>马云可以在渴死之前调动500亿？</p><p>什么，你说支付宝转账？</p><p>带着手机还有网络，马云要你救？</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 31, 6, 592784),
 'create_time': 1536057317,
 'praise_num': 2,
 'question_id': 293366890,
 'update_time': 1536057550,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/485324851',
