2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/501334499 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/501334499 [status:201 request:0.089s]
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 501334499, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/501334499", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "046f3fcfc2eed550bcd407a1e3a2f556", "content": "<p>经济学我不懂，如果我也在沙漠的话，我第一考虑的是我，然后考虑救活两个人。</p><p>救的话，肯定是我能自保的前提下，救那个能救活的，不要钱，三个人能活下来最好。</p><p>舍身取义的话，很艰难的，我这人容易心软，最怕真的到时候不理智，救了他们忘了自己。</p><p>钱不钱的真的无所谓，真能活着救两个人，已经是功德无量了，至于马云给我一笔钱，那就随缘吧，以后有他帮衬做点生意，估计也能几辈子不愁吧</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-30T16:44:55", "update_time": "2018-09-30T16:44:55", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:06.656283"}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"501334499","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
2018-10-04 23:31:06 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/293366890/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=60&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': '046f3fcfc2eed550bcd407a1e3a2f556',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '<p>经济学我不懂，如果我也在沙漠的话，我第一考虑的是我，然后考虑救活两个人。</p><p>救的话，肯定是我能自保的前提下，救那个能救活的，不要钱，三个人能活下来最好。</p><p>舍身取义的话，很艰难的，我这人容易心软，最怕真的到时候不理智，救了他们忘了自己。</p><p>钱不钱的真的无所谓，真能活着救两个人，已经是功德无量了，至于马云给我一笔钱，那就随缘吧，以后有他帮衬做点生意，估计也能几辈子不愁吧</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 31, 6, 656283),
 'create_time': 1538297095,
 'praise_num': 1,
 'question_id': 293366890,
 'update_time': 1538297095,
