2018-10-04 23:31:08 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:08 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/230795634 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:08 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/230795634 [status:201 request:0.079s]
2018-10-04 23:31:08 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 230795634, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/230795634", "question_id": 63972880, "author_id": "2aa1a55326eceac91c9e99c60b73d8a3", "content": "公司觉得你值得加工资自然会加，但是遇到没有任何薪酬制度的公司，三年前3500，三年后还是3500，三年一毛钱不涨的也很正常。就算你提离职也不会加薪留你的，而是打感情牌，谈理想，人都是自私的，我要最小成本留下一个创造价值的员工。老板们只会觉得员工是大傻逼，我公司这么好，你走是你的损失，并且还带威胁，如果跳槽到同行，你知道的，后果很严重。本人现在亲身经历。正在办理离职手续。", "praise_num": 5, "comments_num": 3, "create_time": "2017-09-16T11:31:34", "update_time": "2017-09-16T11:31:34", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:08.239269"}
