2018-10-04 23:31:21 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/456511749 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/456511749 [status:201 request:0.110s]
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 456511749, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/456511749", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "fefedebf8df7df780d2040b02286c020", "content": "无为而治，老子是明确反对努力的。<br>不尚贤，使民不争。  <br>不贵难得之货，使民不为盗。<br>努力是一种恶性竞争，衡水学生再努力也无法增加一个北大名额，反而恶化了所有人的生存环境。", "praise_num": 22, "comments_num": 3, "create_time": "2018-07-31T06:33:24", "update_time": "2018-07-31T06:46:44", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:21.349651"}
