2018-10-04 23:31:21 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/460938476 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/460938476 [status:201 request:0.092s]
2018-10-04 23:31:21 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 460938476, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/460938476", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "01e61ba709e84a0d696eb19d6e8b84eb", "content": "<p>首先要明白你们都是刍狗。一个纸做的玩意，什么是努力？</p><p>另外，道德经也没说努力没用，人家很清晰的表达过，努力比不努力好。</p><p>说俗一点，努力了，虽然不能让太阳从西边出来（或是能在北京买别墅或者做资产阶级），但多养一个娃还是可以的。</p>", "praise_num": 5, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-08-05T10:44:51", "update_time": "2018-08-05T10:44:51", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:21.680834"}
