2018-10-04 23:31:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 469716500, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/469716500", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "2410b44fc44cc3e009d63c1f81f0ff59", "content": "<p>我觉得道德经等著作，包括欧陆英美哲学，</p><p>它们阐述的是终极，知识性的。</p><p>不完全是行为规范。</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-15T17:13:09", "update_time": "2018-08-15T17:13:09", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:22.330510"}
