2018-10-04 23:31:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 489476080, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/489476080", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "57b71dc0a50428bbfa1440887d144252", "content": "<p>我仔细思考过，其实大多数社会底层人员不是不想努力，而是连努力的方向都找不到，就算有了，也不知道用身体为代价的努力究竟能得到什么。</p>", "praise_num": 11, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-09-11T13:13:35", "update_time": "2018-09-11T13:13:35", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:22.885698"}
