2018-10-04 23:31:23 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 369322955, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/369322955", "question_id": 273604946, "author_id": "bfc70b8c71633422e7e247c5800501fa", "content": "<p>我觉得单机游戏都挺难安利的……一是身边朋友完全不理解为什么要花钱买游戏，他们吃鸡都是只玩手游的……二是他们也完全不想花时间去体验什么剧情，去耗脑力想什么战略之类的   所以基本每天都是他们吃鸡吃得热火朝天而我一个人在不死镇受苦，在图岑卡被巨螯射爆，被刚果黑叔叔谴责，砍爆死神利维坦，被岳父一拳ko……其实有时候也会感觉蛮孤单的，但是每当触摸地上的符文，一个个金色的身影慢慢升起做着“赞美太阳”的时候，心里就会感觉“啊，在遥远的地方也有像我一样的人呢”，还是觉得暖暖的(压级薪王警告)</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e46bcc4612b800e23d62eb9a0c1887f6_b.gif\" data-rawwidth=\"420\" data-rawheight=\"236\" data-size=\"normal\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e46bcc4612b800e23d62eb9a0c1887f6_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"420\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='420'%20height='236'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"420\" data-rawheight=\"236\" data-size=\"normal\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e46bcc4612b800e23d62eb9a0c1887f6_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"420\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e46bcc4612b800e23d62eb9a0c1887f6_b.gif\"></figure><p>(图源自黑暗之魂3贴吧，侵删)</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffc9f0a98c59e713f295dfbdf2381c40_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"3017\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffc9f0a98c59e713f295dfbdf2381c40_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='3017'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"3017\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffc9f0a98c59e713f295dfbdf2381c40_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffc9f0a98c59e713f295dfbdf2381c40_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-031895bd44ecdf3a9abe1ab6ff62ac5c_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"3200\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-031895bd44ecdf3a9abe1ab6ff62ac5c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='3200'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"3200\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-031895bd44ecdf3a9abe1ab6ff62ac5c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-031895bd44ecdf3a9abe1ab6ff62ac5c_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-07031d2228e0d971f3946209b4fcd472_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2599\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-07031d2228e0d971f3946209b4fcd472_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='2599'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2599\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-07031d2228e0d971f3946209b4fcd472_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-07031d2228e0d971f3946209b4fcd472_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3b11c52126d04dc48c4d01553dca559_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2474\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3b11c52126d04dc48c4d01553dca559_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='2474'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2474\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3b11c52126d04dc48c4d01553dca559_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3b11c52126d04dc48c4d01553dca559_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-2d61f8800d6a07f76d54341cb7fb7d8d_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2411\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-2d61f8800d6a07f76d54341cb7fb7d8d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='2411'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2411\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-2d61f8800d6a07f76d54341cb7fb7d8d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-2d61f8800d6a07f76d54341cb7fb7d8d_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c2a54d8b1a42a9967961a29b2f6d29dd_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2314\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c2a54d8b1a42a9967961a29b2f6d29dd_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='655'%20height='2314'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"655\" data-rawheight=\"2314\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"655\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c2a54d8b1a42a9967961a29b2f6d29dd_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c2a54d8b1a42a9967961a29b2f6d29dd_b.jpg\"></figure><p>(图源自微博@那须桃子 大大，侵删)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>哇。人生第一次百赞，谢谢各位猛男(手动滑稽)</p><p><br></p><p>破千了！哇！！激动</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a8c492a468a6fbd10696318f94ffedea_b.gif\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"180\" data-size=\"normal\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a8c492a468a6fbd10696318f94ffedea_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"320\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='320'%20height='180'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"180\" data-size=\"normal\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a8c492a468a6fbd10696318f94ffedea_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"320\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a8c492a468a6fbd10696318f94ffedea_b.gif\"></figure><p>————————————</p><p>为什么你们都没人get到图一的笑点，当时我看到笑了一天，帅不过三秒系列</p>", "praise_num": 2547, "comments_num": 477, "create_time": "2018-04-17T20:40:30", "update_time": "2018-04-26T10:23:29", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:23.222181"}
