2018-10-04 23:31:23 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 436896172, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/436896172", "question_id": 273604946, "author_id": "9a950ee742d4704818b58227ba5916ff", "content": "<p>《极限巅峰》（《Steep》）又名《阿尔卑斯山滑雪模拟》、《狗吔屎模拟器》。</p><p>游戏售价￥118，历史最低￥35。</p><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//store.steampowered.com/app/460920/Steep/%3Fsnr%3D1_7_7_204_150_3\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3be6f9f7f63d881f4d30f2f3269c7df2_r.jpg\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Steep™ on Steam</a><blockquote> 在阿尔卑斯山脉的广阔开放世界中，无尽遨游飘落新鲜细雪的天地。 独自一人或与好友一同挑战，称霸最险峻的高山，自由体验滑雪、飞鼠装滑翔、单板滑雪与滑翔伞飞行的快感。记录并分享你的最佳表现。</blockquote><p> 放几张图大家感受一下：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3badb7164333cc2e9342413ab1d2e8b7_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e3f73dd8b34fb397c86efa50e6798ce2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3badb7164333cc2e9342413ab1d2e8b7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='4096'%20height='2303'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e3f73dd8b34fb397c86efa50e6798ce2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3badb7164333cc2e9342413ab1d2e8b7_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3badb7164333cc2e9342413ab1d2e8b7_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bdfd364e43d70d05eed5f9a3a139d87c_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6e99405ce0f5d58334b3ada1a30a70ff_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bdfd364e43d70d05eed5f9a3a139d87c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='4096'%20height='2303'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6e99405ce0f5d58334b3ada1a30a70ff_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bdfd364e43d70d05eed5f9a3a139d87c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bdfd364e43d70d05eed5f9a3a139d87c_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bf7c312167e82819225eb13965b718f2_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-319ded5eac4e0be4086b398ad0e4d582_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bf7c312167e82819225eb13965b718f2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='4096'%20height='2303'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-319ded5eac4e0be4086b398ad0e4d582_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bf7c312167e82819225eb13965b718f2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bf7c312167e82819225eb13965b718f2_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e09e93c0cce01d5526d09e990c362c9_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-bccc3621652143cd079302ac5c408551_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e09e93c0cce01d5526d09e990c362c9_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='4096'%20height='2303'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"4096\" data-rawheight=\"2303\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-bccc3621652143cd079302ac5c408551_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"4096\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e09e93c0cce01d5526d09e990c362c9_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e09e93c0cce01d5526d09e990c362c9_b.jpg\"></figure><p>基于天赋和身体条件上的不足，我们很难像一个专业极限运动员那样在生活中去尝试，《极限巅峰》（《Steep》）给玩家带来了平时不容易有机会接触到的极限运动的虚拟体验。</p><hr><p>除了游戏本身，我还想说两个和《极限巅峰》（《Steep》）相关的故事：</p><p>一是一位专业极限运动员，瑞典的女滑雪运动员Matilda Rapaport，她在智利安第斯山脉给《极限巅峰》（《Steep》）拍短片提供游戏素材的时候意外葬身雪山。</p><p> 二是一位普通玩家、一位中国少年，他叫猫猫侠（supercat）。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c1e0b490cc99ba53005ead6f844798b8_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"766\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-dc1bc170840de353b8c6bc447e5f9c3f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"766\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c1e0b490cc99ba53005ead6f844798b8_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='766'%20height='561'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"766\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-dc1bc170840de353b8c6bc447e5f9c3f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"766\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c1e0b490cc99ba53005ead6f844798b8_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c1e0b490cc99ba53005ead6f844798b8_b.jpg\"></figure><p> 截止2018年7月8号，已经有超过1300位玩家为其祝福，游戏官方还表示将在阿尔卑斯山脉上建立一座猫雪人雕像以纪念这位玩家。</p><hr><p>大概是因为极限运动题材的小众，游戏一直不温不热，<b>虽然很难安利出去，但是我仍旧想尝试一下，知难而上不就是极限运动的乐趣所在</b>。</p><hr><p>应评论要求，放一个“狗吔屎”的视频：</p><a class=\"video-box\" href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.zhihu.com/video/1000420621716582400\" target=\"_blank\" data-video-id=\"\" data-video-playable=\"\" data-name=\"“自由碰撞”关卡\" data-poster=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-fd51276a49b1947b95ede9d8985e3b4e_b.jpg\" data-lens-id=\"1000420621716582400\">              <img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-fd51276a49b1947b95ede9d8985e3b4e_b.jpg\">              <span class=\"content\">                <span class=\"title\">“自由碰撞”关卡<span class=\"z-ico-extern-gray\"></span><span class=\"z-ico-extern-blue\"></span></span>                <span class=\"url\"><span class=\"z-ico-video\"></span>https://www.zhihu.com/video/1000420621716582400</span>              </span>            </a>            ", "praise_num": 1561, "comments_num": 504, "create_time": "2018-07-08T09:39:06", "update_time": "2018-08-20T01:24:39", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:23.781839"}
