2018-10-04 23:31:24 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:24 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/371996065 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
