2018-10-04 23:31:24 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 369348659, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/369348659", "question_id": 273604946, "author_id": "3aa922768276666175ca99dd966935af", "content": "<p>兰斯系列肯定算一个……</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fc7f82b5f8b5cb5159152645b6b8e87_b.png\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"587\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fc7f82b5f8b5cb5159152645b6b8e87_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='587'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"587\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fc7f82b5f8b5cb5159152645b6b8e87_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fc7f82b5f8b5cb5159152645b6b8e87_b.png\"></figure><p>首先游戏肯定是好游戏，毕竟和隔壁e社的战女神系列一样，推妹子+还算不错的游戏性+完整（起码能自圆其说）的世界观，在“好玩”层面简直就是对宅宝具</p><p><br></p><p>但是！特么的太鬼畜了！</p><p><br></p><p>我这种杀过知更鸟唱过沙耶歌的玩这种游戏在某些地方还有些许不爽（R6的菲利斯，R7的香姬），你让我怎么安利给我周边顶多在steam上玩玩猫的老哥们ಸ_ಸ</p><p>当然你可能觉得只在steam上撸猫不算太宅，其实我也曾经成功安利兰斯7给一个平时玩柚子社的老哥……</p><p>然后他玩到雪姬那就玩不下去了……在我的怂恿下还是接着玩……于是玩到香姬那，他和我说他直接删了，以后就是兰斯黑粉了……</p><p><br></p><p>反向安利你怕不怕ಸ_ಸ</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7771ecac1dbc97a7006914b2b0f152fa_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"169\" data-rawheight=\"164\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"169\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='169'%20height='164'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"169\" data-rawheight=\"164\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"169\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7771ecac1dbc97a7006914b2b0f152fa_b.jpg\"></figure><p></p>", "praise_num": 88, "comments_num": 69, "create_time": "2018-04-17T21:19:18", "update_time": "2018-04-17T21:19:18", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:24.570752"}
