2018-10-04 23:31:25 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/493722824 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:25 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/493722824 [status:201 request:0.079s]
2018-10-04 23:31:25 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 493722824, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/493722824", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "206cba5ff57c383a2d9932d3bcb3ed7a", "content": "<p>外来语如果只是英语就算了</p><p>但是它还有法语德语西班牙语葡萄牙语希腊语……</p><p>你说这玩意咋学啊？</p><p>外国人突然看到一大串假名不知道是什么东西就算了</p><p>日本人自己都看不明白</p><p>本来日语就够难学了</p><p>还要用外来语来折磨人</p><p>太痛苦了</p><p>实名diss外来语</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-18T11:56:50", "update_time": "2018-09-18T11:56:50", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:25.429927"}
