2018-10-04 23:31:25 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:25 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/281789987 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:25 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/281789987 [status:201 request:0.233s]
2018-10-04 23:31:25 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 281789987, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281789987", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "e903e9a49c969b7c91106d90aeb57a07", "content": "<p>我觉得日语最好建立一套完整的希腊拉丁词根词缀对译标准，不要再老直接拿英语这个元音鬼畜变异的二道贩子的读音了，英语鬼畜的元音体系对日语这种元音简单的语言极其不友好，不如直接去希腊拉丁那里拿原型。</p>", "praise_num": 62, "comments_num": 8, "create_time": "2017-12-23T21:57:48", "update_time": "2017-12-23T21:57:49", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:25.511349"}
