2018-10-04 23:31:26 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 480017940, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/480017940", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "f4d019e0c06fdbeba1c361b2eb2fcebb", "content": "<p>早期食管癌主要表现为三感一痛：吞咽哽噎感、异物感、胸骨后不适感、胸骨后疼痛</p><p><br></p><p>结合题主的症状及体征但凡有医学常识的人都能联想到那方面去，何况一个有多年丰富经验的内科医生了，而无论是食管ca还是普通的食管炎，胃炎，最能明确诊断且有效的无疑是无痛胃镜，这是对你负责也是医生对自己负责，个人认为并不存在滥用检查的情况（之前食管溃疡我也做过，出来结果后配合药物治疗很快就好了，只求个心安）</p><p><br></p><p>一个能明确诊断，一个靠百度碰运气，当然你可以自己选，运气好吃些药自己缓解没事妥妥的，说句不好听的有事的话可不是百度能解决的，现在医患矛盾不少，你可以不信任医生，但请不要再诋毁医生</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a1ba9ce872bac26281738699dcf3681b_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"690\" data-rawheight=\"516\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1f4caceba170f0f37637febad358b208_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"690\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a1ba9ce872bac26281738699dcf3681b_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='690'%20height='516'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"690\" data-rawheight=\"516\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1f4caceba170f0f37637febad358b208_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"690\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a1ba9ce872bac26281738699dcf3681b_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a1ba9ce872bac26281738699dcf3681b_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 3, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-28T14:29:47", "update_time": "2018-08-28T14:34:02", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:26.485279"}
