2018-10-04 23:31:27 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:27 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494256778 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:27 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494256778 [status:201 request:0.133s]
2018-10-04 23:31:27 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494256778, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494256778", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "d398627abc72f5dc6c4d10bfa3cb2954", "content": "<p>总的来说，的确是有滥用的现象。</p><p>摘一个关于over testing的定义，以免大家不在一个范围内讨论： </p><p>Over-testing may be defined as the use of: 1) non recommended screening tests in asymptomatic patients, or 2) more testing than necessary to diagnose patients with signs or symptoms. (Over-testing: Why More Is Not Better，<i>The American Journal of Medicine).</i></p><p>本人在美学习Healthcare Management。最近做的project是涉及中美医疗体系对比，通过阅读国内及美国这边的文献，了解到中国的确存在检查滥用现象。摘一段《Economics》的话: \"The system’s current incentives are one major hurdle to innovation. The government funds just 10% of care at public hospitals, for example, leaving hospital administration responsible for the other 90% and for making a profit. Other financial incentives encourage reliance on pharmaceuticals and diagnostic tests. As a result, tests are overused and drugs are widely over-prescribed.\"</p><p>除了滥用检查，防御性医疗行为(defensive medical care)的现象也比较普遍。DMC和滥用检查的出现，与我国法律体系不完善，医患矛盾爆发时执法机关不能很好保护医院、医生的合法权利有关。为了尽量避免诉讼纠纷，医生会进行防御性治疗。</p><p>除此之外，摘录的话中讲出了第二个为什么会有overtreatment&amp;overtesting的原因。第三个原因是，当前中国医疗体系大部分是fee-for-service。什么是fee-for-service, 摘个维基百科：</p><p><b>Fee-for-service</b>(FFS) is a <b>payment </b>model where <b>services </b>are unbundled and paid for separately. In health care, it gives an incentive for physicians to provide more treatments because <b>payment </b>is dependent on the quantity of care, rather than quality of care. </p><p>这种付款模式下，做的检查越多越贵，开的药越多越贵，医院越赚钱。</p><p><br></p><p>Overtreatment和overtesting不在中国独有，美国也有这个问题。不过，造成中国overtesting的还有一个原因是中国独特的医疗体系结构。中国是三级医疗体系，区域间医疗操作、设备、医护人员质量差别会很大，一个情况比较复杂的病人在县级医院、市级医院、省级医院可能会做完全一样的检查，只是因为省级医院不信任县级、市级医院检查结果的准确度。这个属于个人观察。</p><p><br></p><p>因为平时看的是英文资料，接触这个行业也是在国外，所以有些专业性词汇习惯用英文。如果有觉得我中英文夹杂装逼的，闭嘴。</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T09:01:37", "update_time": "2018-09-19T09:07:34", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:27.595698"}
