2018-10-04 23:31:30 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 496194027, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/496194027", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "d59f035ea1673a43115aed7c61e3c371", "content": "<p>单从问题角度回答：一瓶卖1亿，一瓶卖1千就够了。真的不像各位大神能够打出这么多字了。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-22T11:05:12", "update_time": "2018-09-22T11:05:12", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:29.916077"}
