2018-10-04 23:31:31 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494841738, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494841738", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "2d9b9ca7ce240bf598d590caee457d98", "content": "<p>定价3000元一瓶   </p><p> 搞活动  买两瓶第一瓶3000 第二瓶2000   </p><p>想多挣点钱就定价500亿 买一送一</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-09-20T01:58:21", "update_time": "2018-09-20T02:01:57", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:31.107004"}
