2018-10-04 23:31:51 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 377862800, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/377862800", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "0786e82dfb9a2c7383aa3cd2fc043d34", "content": "<p>《道德经》有点像《实践论》，通过大量阅读以及实践，从感性认识上升到理性认识，反过来指导实践。</p><p>普通人只看到了“损之又损，以至无为”，只看到了“不出户，知天下”；没有读到“上士闻道，勤而习之”，没有读到“自胜者强也，强行者有志”。</p><p>修道的人：虚怀若谷，大量积累，反复思索，总结规律，付诸实践，得志天下，功遂身退，百姓皆谓我自然。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"707\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='900'%20height='707'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"707\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-85766baa2ea42bcb9c00e6c250602193_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 8, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-04-28T00:02:45", "update_time": "2018-04-29T10:43:38", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:51.901095"}
