2018-10-04 23:31:52 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/491798542 [status:201 request:0.119s]
2018-10-04 23:31:52 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 491798542, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/491798542", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "ff05c9ac0fba2118af99a68a63fd6b36", "content": "<p>《道德经》是写给King或者Lord的。</p><p>所以，你让他们努力干点啥？</p><p>他们一努力，就是开战。</p><p>“君主的专业，是打仗。”――马基雅维利（这话我确实在《君主论》里说过）</p>", "praise_num": 10, "comments_num": 4, "create_time": "2018-09-15T05:58:29", "update_time": "2018-09-15T07:16:09", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:52.078470"}
