2018-10-04 23:31:52 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:53 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/371340814 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:53 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/371340814 [status:201 request:0.182s]
2018-10-04 23:31:53 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 371340814, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/371340814", "question_id": 273604946, "author_id": "bc818b45bea17dd91213e90207c27c91", "content": "<p>我大骑砍毫无疑问位列榜首啊，第一次在网吧看见有人玩这种上世纪画质的游戏我白眼都快翻到头顶了，一番鄙视之后果断坐下来打开了自己“电影画质”的4A大作COD……</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6f3581efa793d1ea2f9575a3151ebb12_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"855\" data-rawheight=\"506\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"855\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6f3581efa793d1ea2f9575a3151ebb12_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='855'%20height='506'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"855\" data-rawheight=\"506\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"855\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6f3581efa793d1ea2f9575a3151ebb12_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6f3581efa793d1ea2f9575a3151ebb12_b.jpg\"></figure><p>后来不断在网上看到各种单机游戏推荐榜都有骑砍，无聊之下下了一个，一玩……</p><p>我去！</p><p>又能当将军运筹帷幄，</p><p>又能当战士冲锋在前，</p><p>还能当雇佣兵看钱办事。</p><p>什么？还能占领城堡？</p><p>什么？还能独立建国？</p><p>什么？还能分封手下？</p><p>……</p><p>玩累了一看时间，不知不觉已经第二天了……</p><p>从此自动变身骑砍安利员，身边玩游戏的都得安利一回，然而推荐那么多次还是只拉了一个人入坑，其他人看了一眼就回去玩自己的LOL了……</p><p>同样遭遇的还有<b>辐射和Besiege，</b>其实大多数大型单机游戏都不好安利，现在的人已经习惯了王者荣耀、开心消消乐那种几分钟就能高潮一次的短平快碎片化游戏，根本静不下心玩这些必须花费一定时间和精力才能获得快感的深度游戏了。</p><p>在知乎安利了好几次也没几个赞……</p><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/28817604/answer/42210549\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/89098e53bbe017e055dc775db0ba6a20_180x120.jpg\" data-image-width=\"800\" data-image-height=\"640\" class=\"internal\">谁能给我介绍几个有厚重历史感的游戏？</a><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/28033883/answer/39953935\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/89098e53bbe017e055dc775db0ba6a20_180x120.jpg\" data-image-width=\"800\" data-image-height=\"640\" class=\"internal\">配置要求不高又好玩的单机游戏有哪些？</a><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/38506070/answer/77965048\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/8bbcf5ffd542dc61373fba306be4f9e2_180x120.jpg\" data-image-width=\"872\" data-image-height=\"428\" class=\"internal\">有哪些让你感叹脑洞之大，创意绝妙的游戏？</a>", "praise_num": 353, "comments_num": 135, "create_time": "2018-04-20T08:53:16", "update_time": "2018-04-21T16:29:42", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:52.856895"}
