2018-10-04 23:31:54 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 379658388, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/379658388", "question_id": 273604946, "author_id": "915d5d2a7f4ebf0ff0b43d9fe72bc106", "content": "<p>Dream quest</p><p>梦境任务</p><p><br></p><p>杀戮尖塔刚火的时候，我逢人就安利，我说如果你喜欢爬塔那你也会喜欢Dreamquest，爬塔不说山寨但至少模仿它了，有些机制不说完全一样但很相似，你可以去试试。</p><p><br></p><p>炉石出狗头人地下城冒险模式时我特别兴奋，跟所有玩炉石的说快来玩呀，零氪玩家也能爽呀，顺便加一句，做冒险模式这哥们之前做过一款游戏叫Dreamquest，特别好玩，后来被暴雪挖走了。</p><p><br></p><p>但是，即使我这么不遗余力的安利推荐，还都是给玩卡牌游戏的这类人，但很少成功…</p><p><br></p><p>原因大概是……</p><p>它界面长这样:</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8d3854cb0eea4ab1c92e2d255f345cdb_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1526\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f7ab2344e4c6e017b033ac46700bcc1_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1526\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8d3854cb0eea4ab1c92e2d255f345cdb_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1526'%20height='1080'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1526\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f7ab2344e4c6e017b033ac46700bcc1_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1526\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8d3854cb0eea4ab1c92e2d255f345cdb_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8d3854cb0eea4ab1c92e2d255f345cdb_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1940e1bb129b910be0f71c261111e50f_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1478\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a69f69b635823606a0682a7349d723c2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1478\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1940e1bb129b910be0f71c261111e50f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1478'%20height='1080'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1478\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a69f69b635823606a0682a7349d723c2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1478\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1940e1bb129b910be0f71c261111e50f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1940e1bb129b910be0f71c261111e50f_b.jpg\"></figure><p>它纯英文……</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3fc86604c5f29830603c9792d235cfdd_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1478\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b74ac8e9ebadb21117d0bd9dfc3f4451_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1478\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3fc86604c5f29830603c9792d235cfdd_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1478'%20height='1080'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1478\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b74ac8e9ebadb21117d0bd9dfc3f4451_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1478\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3fc86604c5f29830603c9792d235cfdd_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3fc86604c5f29830603c9792d235cfdd_b.jpg\"></figure><p>（虽然非常好懂啊！！！！稍微会一点的就能看明白啊！！！）</p><p>它只在苹果系统有………</p><p>它不是免费游戏………</p><p><br></p><p>但是！！！但是真的很好玩啊！！！</p><p>尤其是，它有大量的角色等待你解锁，每个角色的风格，技能都各异，更厉害的是连敌人的特点也非常鲜明！有很多很有意思很有挑战的怪物！</p><p><br></p><p>如果这样无法说动你，我还会附加一个大招，就是去下载国产免费的月圆之夜吧！那游戏完全山寨的Dreamquest，但是山寨的有模有样，剧情画面方面竟然做的比原作还好，就是太简单各职业都打通一次就没啥意思了！</p><p><br></p><p>可即使如此……身边玩Dreamquest的还是寥寥无几………有苹果系统的朋友恳请你们真的去尝试一下………</p>", "praise_num": 19, "comments_num": 17, "create_time": "2018-04-30T11:49:26", "update_time": "2018-04-30T11:49:26", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:54.198493"}
