2018-10-04 23:31:55 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 484920137, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/484920137", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "663619815afac410cb331f7b9311dc13", "content": "可拉倒吧。我就直接问过日本人，他们看那些外来语知道是啥意思吗？他们也看不懂。所以我就说在日本做英语翻译是真的好做。", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-04T07:57:06", "update_time": "2018-09-04T07:57:06", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:55.315921"}
