2018-10-04 23:31:55 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 281571469, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281571469", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "95f848081cf1dacf7dc488a9a2dbc9eb", "content": "以前中国强就用中文，现在美国强就用英文。没什么不好的，日本从来就是这样啊。", "praise_num": 17, "comments_num": 9, "create_time": "2017-12-23T15:00:12", "update_time": "2017-12-23T15:00:12", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:55.402508"}
