2018-10-04 23:31:56 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:56 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/290354850 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:56 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/290354850 [status:201 request:0.080s]
2018-10-04 23:31:56 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 290354850, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/290354850", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "5e61f3313be18285fc73137a63b5d46f", "content": "<p>今年最尴尬的两个词是【傲娇】【打call】</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0596cc51c2fdf61340572ca5701f0730_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"562\" data-rawheight=\"477\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"562\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0596cc51c2fdf61340572ca5701f0730_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='562'%20height='477'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"562\" data-rawheight=\"477\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"562\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0596cc51c2fdf61340572ca5701f0730_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0596cc51c2fdf61340572ca5701f0730_b.jpg\"></figure><p>这些词已经被使用了好多年了，到主流观众那里意思却变了，不好好用，不去理解他的真实意思，非要重新去给他下个不一样的定义，用都用错了，连官媒都用错，我还能说什么？</p><p>傲娇是一个形容词，形容一个人性格外冷内热、刀子嘴豆腐心、表面上孤傲实际是个热心还可爱的人。他可能对所有人和事都非常严格，但他的内心是为了大家好。</p><p>例句：你爸爸虽然不给你妈好脸，但他心里还是有她的，他是傲娇，他不好意思直接说出心里话。</p><p>把傲<b>娇</b>和<b>骄</b>傲混用是错误的【傲娇了我的国】这种用法是错误的，意思完全不一样，</p><p>【傲娇了我的国】的意思是我的祖国待人吝啬、口是心非、表里不一，但整体来说我的国是个好人。</p><p>这样不行啊，以后可别再这样用了，丢人。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>【打call】是一种丢人的助威活动，当偶像开演唱会唱歌时，会有一些恶心的粉丝自己组织起来，穿统一的丢人的服装，拿着荧光棒，统一得喊口号、做动作夸张的恶心体操，声音吵人，影响他人看演唱会的观感，一场演唱会也就毁了</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-677df231bca939edc6ea9797c5942f1e_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"192\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-677df231bca939edc6ea9797c5942f1e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"390\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='390'%20height='192'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"192\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-677df231bca939edc6ea9797c5942f1e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"390\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-677df231bca939edc6ea9797c5942f1e_b.gif\"></figure><p>【为祖国打call】的意思是，我要对着祖国做丢人的事</p><p>最起码你在用“打call”的时候，你得知道你已经承认自己丢人了啊，</p><p>偶像粉可以说为爱抖打call，因为偶像粉本来就恶心，偶像粉用打call这个词在合适不过了</p><p><br></p><p>可是爱国并不是一件丢人的事，祖国与打call是不能放在一起用的</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fe8d8b413184106de9c4ec88ba63002_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"180\" data-rawheight=\"179\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fe8d8b413184106de9c4ec88ba63002_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"180\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='180'%20height='179'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"180\" data-rawheight=\"179\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fe8d8b413184106de9c4ec88ba63002_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"180\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fe8d8b413184106de9c4ec88ba63002_b.gif\"></figure><p><br></p><p>打call本来就恶心，乱用就得承担后果，下面这个漫画非常写实没有丑化任何一方，仅仅是客观地科普【为祖国打call】如果实际去做是个什么样子</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0e6204667449f1952f6b0065501f59de_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"211\" data-rawheight=\"3006\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"211\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='211'%20height='3006'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"211\" data-rawheight=\"3006\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"211\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0e6204667449f1952f6b0065501f59de_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 12, "comments_num": 16, "create_time": "2018-01-06T16:01:56", "update_time": "2018-01-06T16:06:33", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:56.426811"}
