2018-10-04 23:31:58 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 389520330, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/389520330", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "9ac106c862ba298268c539f87dc46f7b", "content": "<p>对啊，医患纠纷没有证据，医院赔钱，大夫赔钱啊，你挂号才5块。这你得去问问当时造谣缝肛门的孕妇得到了多少钱。</p>", "praise_num": 5, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-05-12T09:57:39", "update_time": "2018-05-12T09:57:39", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:58.179957"}
