2018-10-04 23:31:58 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:58 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494665761 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:58 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494665761 [status:201 request:0.063s]
2018-10-04 23:31:58 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494665761, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494665761", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "ab9cc9647685ba81eb6f4f62978cd5b5", "content": "<p>我白送给马云，卖穷人2000。如果普通人都有能力运水进沙漠，要救马云的除了政府还有一大票生意伙伴，分分钟抢在前面把马云接走了，还不如卖个人情给马云。而跟穷人只怕只有一锤子买卖，救了他他未必记得你；可是以马云的地位，又有一群救援者可以见证赠水，他不敢忘了你的。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T19:55:39", "update_time": "2018-09-19T19:56:58", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:58.715630"}
