2018-10-04 23:31:59 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494644057, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494644057", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "e8cb4c94ff70d4e418e8ae2777efb926", "content": "正常价差不多十块钱一瓶矿泉水卖给马云，比超市贵是我运过来成本比较高。<br>不卖给题主，把知乎问这些SD问题的人都渴死，这样知乎就清净了。", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T19:12:03", "update_time": "2018-09-19T19:12:03", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:58.946907"}
