2018-10-04 23:31:59 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/293366890/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=100&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': 'e8cb4c94ff70d4e418e8ae2777efb926',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '正常价差不多十块钱一瓶矿泉水卖给马云，比超市贵是我运过来成本比较高。<br>不卖给题主，把知乎问这些SD问题的人都渴死，这样知乎就清净了。',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 31, 58, 946907),
 'create_time': 1537355523,
 'praise_num': 1,
 'question_id': 293366890,
 'update_time': 1537355523,
