2018-10-04 23:31:59 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:31:59 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494632973 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:31:59 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494632973 [status:201 request:0.105s]
2018-10-04 23:31:59 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494632973, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494632973", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "45446b6dfb880bc29c5a6af2cdd7a9b5", "content": "<p>在我觉得这道问题，该思考的对象不是买家本身，而是卖家的我。一种货物，不管买家是谁，一样要同价对待。如果真的向马云要几个亿买一瓶水，这和黑心商有什么区别。不要变成自己讨厌的人的样子！</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-19T18:50:41", "update_time": "2018-09-19T18:50:41", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:31:59.540445"}
