2018-10-04 23:32:00 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:00 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494556011 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:00 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494556011 [status:201 request:0.089s]
2018-10-04 23:32:00 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494556011, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494556011", "question_id": 293366890, "author_id": "2748a2a89d212343b110286d5b60265c", "content": "<p>不懂经济学，潜意识答题，勿喷。</p><p>考虑供求关系的前提应该是没有垄断吧？你现在已经是垄断地位，就算马云只要1瓶而你有10瓶，供大于求，你依然可以坐地起价。抛开道德，从利益角度出发，当然是定价500亿，或者定价500亿2000，买一送一，逼他俩合资买。</p><p>正确出题，你应该假设有两个商人，各有一瓶水，一口价时如何定价。这个时候你就会发现供求一致有多厉害了，永远有人愿意比你少赚一块钱。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 2, "create_time": "2018-09-19T16:42:44", "update_time": "2018-09-19T16:42:44", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:00.658073"}
2018-10-04 23:32:00 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"494556011","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
