2018-10-04 23:32:04 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/63972880/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=80&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': '0',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '我离职前接到过领导电话，问我是不是因为薪资问题才要离开的，我挺想笑的，之前几个月，领导因为一些事已经表达过不满，这是之前几年从没有过的，另一个，我不认为自己的工作不可替换，所以就拒绝了领导所谓再考虑一下的虚伪挽留。',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 32, 4, 12151),
