2018-10-04 23:32:08 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 470927841, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/470927841", "question_id": 64408536, "author_id": "a1fd735961b060f7454340d79c3ed050", "content": "有长崎尚志的浦泽直树和没长崎尚志的浦泽是两回事。<br>浦泽并没有独力完成任何一部带政治悬疑风格的作品。<br>浦泽独力完成的作品没烂尾。", "praise_num": 12, "comments_num": 2, "create_time": "2018-08-17T03:28:01", "update_time": "2018-08-17T03:28:01", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:08.264945"}
