2018-10-04 23:32:08 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:08 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/471948811 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:08 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/471948811 [status:201 request:0.076s]
2018-10-04 23:32:08 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 471948811, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/471948811", "question_id": 64408536, "author_id": "b23f13d25bb2959cd61bd66716be3078", "content": "<p>只看过二十世纪少年</p><p><br></p><p>严重过誉的作品，充其量就是“年代神作”，意思就是只有在当年连载才有这种影响力，放到现在就是狗屎一坨，同理圣斗士星矢和幽游白书。</p><p><br></p><p>这部漫画，全篇充斥着完全不合理的剧情发展，在此之上的人物令人感觉充满了假煽情，悬念铺太大自己还圆不上，最后boss悬疑了整部漫画，最后找了个不知名人士完事</p><p><br></p><p>不服来喷，从这个年代从头开始看一遍，我就是这个结论</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-18T13:59:13", "update_time": "2018-08-18T13:59:13", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:08.692735"}
2018-10-04 23:32:08 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"471948811","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
2018-10-04 23:32:08 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/64408536/answers?include=data%5B*%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B*%5D.mark_infos%5B*%5D.url%3Bdata%5B*%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B*%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=0&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': 'b23f13d25bb2959cd61bd66716be3078',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '<p>只看过二十世纪少年</p><p><br></p><p>严重过誉的作品，充其量就是“年代神作”，意思就是只有在当年连载才有这种影响力，放到现在就是狗屎一坨，同理圣斗士星矢和幽游白书。</p><p><br></p><p>这部漫画，全篇充斥着完全不合理的剧情发展，在此之上的人物令人感觉充满了假煽情，悬念铺太大自己还圆不上，最后boss悬疑了整部漫画，最后找了个不知名人士完事</p><p><br></p><p>不服来喷，从这个年代从头开始看一遍，我就是这个结论</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 32, 8, 692735),
 'create_time': 1534571953,
