2018-10-04 23:32:22 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/281604095 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/281604095 [status:201 request:0.082s]
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 281604095, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281604095", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "02b2dd86f15f16761065f6c311fc061f", "content": "<p>曾经看过一个采访，问日本留学生认为中国奇怪的地方，日本人回答很奇怪中国人喜欢在汉字里面插入英文。</p><p><br></p><p>虽然我自己看着大段的片假就心累，不过说到底都是各自的习惯吧，据说因为这个原因日本人英语水平还比较高呢。</p>", "praise_num": 3, "comments_num": 13, "create_time": "2017-12-23T16:04:03", "update_time": "2017-12-23T16:04:03", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:22.109198"}
