2018-10-04 23:32:22 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/264479217/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=80&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': '02b2dd86f15f16761065f6c311fc061f',
 'comments_num': 13,
 'content': '<p>曾经看过一个采访，问日本留学生认为中国奇怪的地方，日本人回答很奇怪中国人喜欢在汉字里面插入英文。</p><p><br></p><p>虽然我自己看着大段的片假就心累，不过说到底都是各自的习惯吧，据说因为这个原因日本人英语水平还比较高呢。</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 32, 22, 109198),
 'create_time': 1514016243,
 'praise_num': 3,
 'question_id': 264479217,
 'update_time': 1514016243,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281604095',
 'zhihu_id': 281604095}
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/419310557 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/419310557 [status:201 request:0.039s]
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 419310557, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/419310557", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "bcbbd52a993658fcb6356ef55eb0b833", "content": "<p>不太清楚别人怎么想，不过我觉得日语中的外来语超赞的，大幅度降低理解难度。很多糊成一团的片假名，在心里默念几遍也就猜出意思来了，都不需要特意去记，还能带来解谜一般的爽快感。</p><p>有些人说什么“外来语侵蚀本土文化”，这大概属于瞎替别家人操心了。稍微看多点片子都知道，尽管如今标题大多都用アナル，但片里演员们喊的，还是以おしり、けつ居多呀。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-06-17T08:02:07", "update_time": "2018-06-17T08:02:07", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:22.193228"}
2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"419310557","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
