2018-10-04 23:32:22 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 416844657, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/416844657", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "5703100e9ff0e346784d8574cf588875", "content": "<p>很多片假名词汇既然是纯音译，还不如直接用英语得了。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-06-13T20:21:22", "update_time": "2018-06-13T20:21:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:22.862657"}
