2018-10-04 23:32:24 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 476846727, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/476846727", "question_id": 276620139, "author_id": "09146e92717edae2fa0ce00f84a2fe06", "content": "<p>病人:医生，请你一定要把我全身检查好，不然我出事了都是医生的错，但是呢，你不能用仪器检查，只能用眼睛，仪器太贵了，我舍不得，谢谢啦。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>原答案</p><p>案例1:一个人感冒了，一直咳嗽，很严重，去医院，然后医生给他开了感冒药，不久后死于肺病，然后家属来医闹。</p><p><br></p><p>案例2:一个人感冒了，一直咳嗽，很严重，去医院，医生担心肺上有问题，进行了检查，结果只是单纯的感冒，然后上网发帖质疑医生滥用检查。</p><p><br></p><p>案例3:一个人感冒了，一直咳嗽，很严重，去医院，医生担心肺上有问题，进行了检查，结果真的肺上有问题，已经很严重了，然后亲戚之间流传“本来什么事都没有的，到医院就检查出病了”。</p><p><br></p><p>案例1会导致医生自身利益甚至身体受损，别扯白衣天使，医生也要养家糊口，觉得医生收入超高的赶紧让自己孩子学医，将来吃喝不愁。</p><p>案例23会导致医生的声誉受损，但至少不会影响自己的身家性命。</p><p><br></p><p>请问，你是医生，你选择怎么做？</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>（我不是医生，从事IT行业，不过我的学校是个医学院，身边很多学医的朋友，女朋友学药，所以医生与我并没有利益关系，仅仅觉得医生真的没大家想的那么不堪，那些极少数黑心医生除外）</p><p><br></p><p>（我去年毕业，低我一届的学生在我刚毕业的时候，刚好出去医院实习，来了个病人，问医生在不在，那个医生不在，就掏出准备好的菜刀一刀砍在那个学妹头上，呵，白衣天使）</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1b437e50eba2f98b8630d30a80ffc3af_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"4039\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fee7ae18f7b5ef9ab487817c954c43ac_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1b437e50eba2f98b8630d30a80ffc3af_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='4039'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"4039\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fee7ae18f7b5ef9ab487817c954c43ac_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1b437e50eba2f98b8630d30a80ffc3af_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-1b437e50eba2f98b8630d30a80ffc3af_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7fa06993a3011aa0c90d776d8bc1fdb0_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d4112eec39dc15addcc1d5167e5d49f2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7fa06993a3011aa0c90d776d8bc1fdb0_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1440'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d4112eec39dc15addcc1d5167e5d49f2_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7fa06993a3011aa0c90d776d8bc1fdb0_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7fa06993a3011aa0c90d776d8bc1fdb0_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b470bf15e3ac327600443e6e2a4b9773_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-98a7245b0ac495dfeb380f3b6d77573f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b470bf15e3ac327600443e6e2a4b9773_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1440'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-98a7245b0ac495dfeb380f3b6d77573f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b470bf15e3ac327600443e6e2a4b9773_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b470bf15e3ac327600443e6e2a4b9773_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0bfe9999c7f0e2d4fe995c5d3cfe2dd4_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d49bbe01526f12998891ee3bd0158119_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0bfe9999c7f0e2d4fe995c5d3cfe2dd4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1440'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d49bbe01526f12998891ee3bd0158119_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0bfe9999c7f0e2d4fe995c5d3cfe2dd4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0bfe9999c7f0e2d4fe995c5d3cfe2dd4_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d15c9929ed43896a8b18be056adbbdaf_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-024f50a34281f07a056a9ffdb3d1e8cd_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d15c9929ed43896a8b18be056adbbdaf_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-024f50a34281f07a056a9ffdb3d1e8cd_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d15c9929ed43896a8b18be056adbbdaf_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d15c9929ed43896a8b18be056adbbdaf_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffd776215717ba29f567ef4a09e3a3b0_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"596\" data-rawheight=\"1060\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-aff8a61c95a732cba88bbb6cff2e834b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"596\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffd776215717ba29f567ef4a09e3a3b0_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='596'%20height='1060'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"596\" data-rawheight=\"1060\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-aff8a61c95a732cba88bbb6cff2e834b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"596\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffd776215717ba29f567ef4a09e3a3b0_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffd776215717ba29f567ef4a09e3a3b0_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-dc0ee30953572e991bcbc54407cc2f0a_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"540\" data-rawheight=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-09af55870c12d8df9841715b5b652c96_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"540\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-dc0ee30953572e991bcbc54407cc2f0a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='540'%20height='960'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"540\" data-rawheight=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-09af55870c12d8df9841715b5b652c96_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"540\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-dc0ee30953572e991bcbc54407cc2f0a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-dc0ee30953572e991bcbc54407cc2f0a_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-22424d1365fd04714eb5bb3d370086c7_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-dd5f5bdcd352350250d6a422159d1de9_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-22424d1365fd04714eb5bb3d370086c7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img 