2018-10-04 23:32:25 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 363190718, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/363190718", "question_id": 271401470, "author_id": "62825867e6836589f3ed4d7fc63d77b4", "content": "目前主机玩家大幅提升，相比以前更多玩家愿意购买游戏主机，也愿意购买正版游戏。产能不足是目前缺货的主要原因吧。", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-04-10T15:15:23", "update_time": "2018-04-10T15:15:24", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:25.288341"}
