2018-10-04 23:32:38 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 471165662, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/471165662", "question_id": 290129514, "author_id": "f63764491c83bb800862b45538f5ebbc", "content": "<p>提名《四驱兄弟》和《陀螺战士》以及《超速YOYO球》，这几部动画已经使我分不清<b>先有周边后有动画</b>还是<b>先有动画后有周边</b>了。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fc8faa91baf7a5b5f7875ccb77203a2_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"435\" data-rawheight=\"317\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-71e4ed708f3d354430a43f11e88cadc6_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"435\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fc8faa91baf7a5b5f7875ccb77203a2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='435'%20height='317'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"435\" data-rawheight=\"317\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-71e4ed708f3d354430a43f11e88cadc6_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"435\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fc8faa91baf7a5b5f7875ccb77203a2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9fc8faa91baf7a5b5f7875ccb77203a2_b.jpg\"></figure><p>在我小时候的眼里，这部动画的周边是最没良心的，说好的龙卷风闪电跑法走墙壁空气炮空气刀呢？起码把那台叫巨无霸的增加点重量吧？</p><p>至于后来的记忆芯片和声控功能，我已经不抱希望了。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ccdb95c9b75e491ea0bacda5fcd8e4c9_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"477\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-08a6be8a3e2fc9550bf07997b3952123_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ccdb95c9b75e491ea0bacda5fcd8e4c9_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='477'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"477\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-08a6be8a3e2fc9550bf07997b3952123_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ccdb95c9b75e491ea0bacda5fcd8e4c9_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ccdb95c9b75e491ea0bacda5fcd8e4c9_b.jpg\"></figure><p>我读小学时，这种玩具一度红得发紫，学校里到处是“滋滋滋”的马达声，如果没有这部动画，我很难想象这种没有遥控功能的玩具车会火到这个地步。</p><p>如果我没记错，《四驱兄弟》的前身《四驱小子》还提出了一个“四驱车不是玩具”的理论。</p><p>紧接《四驱兄弟》之后的，就是陀螺主题的《陀螺战士》和溜溜球主题的《超速YOYO球》，同样的手法让玩具大卖。近来有一部叫《火力种田王》的真人剧，也是溜溜球主题的，但我的童年不是这个。</p><p>是的，以上三种玩具我都有。（暴露年龄系列）</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6078bce00290c455bb4a4d5c4aa2d40c_b.jpg\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a0359002f0b7876a0d83529d9233d30_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6078bce00290c455bb4a4d5c4aa2d40c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='640'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a0359002f0b7876a0d83529d9233d30_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6078bce00290c455bb4a4d5c4aa2d40c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6078bce00290c455bb4a4d5c4aa2d40c_b.jpg\"><figcaption>这是动画</figcaption></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9d52bd147fcd74481bd9974edbf9311d_b.jpg\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"310\" data-rawheight=\"310\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e0accc68e2f9481e5e0f3f129a8ea222_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"310\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='310'%20height='310'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"310\" data-rawheight=\"310\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e0accc68e2f9481e5e0f3f129a8ea222_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"310\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9d52bd147fcd74481bd9974edbf9311d_b.jpg\"><figcaption>这是周边</figcaption></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f90bae0b362a8db7671beca93c73cd80_b.jpg\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"436\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3812ca2a6930aeaf3ba8f82d9725c89_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f90bae0b362a8db7671beca93c73cd80_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='436'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"436\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3812ca2a6930aeaf3ba8f82d9725c89_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f90bae0b362a8db7671beca93c73cd80_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f90bae0b362a8db7671beca93c73cd80_b.jpg\"><figcaption>这是动画</figcaption></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1a9cc245511b1b70940712138581a395_b.jpg\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"680\" data-rawheight=\"680\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4e50a72dfb73e8f00f88c1dc14ce1e1f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"680\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1a9cc245511b1b70940712138581a395_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='680'%20height='680'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"680\" data-rawheight=\"680\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4e50a72dfb73e8f00f88c1dc14ce1e1f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"680\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1a9cc245511b1b70940712138581a395_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1a9cc245511b1b70940712138581a395_b.jpg\"><figcaption>这是周边</figcaption></figure><p>这是最近新拍的《火力种田王》也是玩的神仙溜溜球。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-340ec507b0636b168af1fab443c742c7_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"294\" data-rawheight=\"450\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-ceec1ac5c07a2148f9e5e6735c722337_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"294\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='294'%20height='450'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"294\" data-rawheight=\"450\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-ceec1ac5c07a2148f9e5e6735c722337_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"294\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-340ec507b0636b168af1fab443c742c7_b.jpg\"></figure><p></p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2018-08-17T12:55:26", "update_time": "2018-08-17T13:39:42", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:38.474549"}
