2018-10-04 23:32:38 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 470718258, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/470718258", "question_id": 290129514, "author_id": "39637f2d64f59d240eaef5d487306943", "content": "<p>高达</p><p><br></p><p>高达之父富野由悠季曾经说，机器人动画片不过是30分钟的玩具广告。</p><p>高达制作的初心可见一斑。</p><p>但是，从第一部0079开始，这个男人就赋予了高达动画完全不同于其他机器人动画的沉重。</p><p>不管是人物的刻画，故事情节的跌宕起伏，战争的残酷表现，都远超同时代的动画作品。</p><p>而后续的作品也不是单一为了热血机器人打斗而制作，更多的视角都是在讲好一个故事的同时来展现高达的魅力。</p><p>最终高达成为日本动画的丰碑，也同时成为机器人模型的霸主。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-314619e97e90b53bea4305bed3cb0ac4_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"576\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1ee63c9d54dd69c0447a0e2d81652e09_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"576\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-314619e97e90b53bea4305bed3cb0ac4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='576'%20height='600'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"576\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1ee63c9d54dd69c0447a0e2d81652e09_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"576\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-314619e97e90b53bea4305bed3cb0ac4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-314619e97e90b53bea4305bed3cb0ac4_b.jpg\"></figure><p>第一代，元祖高达 </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d51e16b538c81f008881f4190beebd3a_b.jpg\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-17f82f2c361d795df797b7a91f33dff8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d51e16b538c81f008881f4190beebd3a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='640'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-17f82f2c361d795df797b7a91f33dff8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d51e16b538c81f008881f4190beebd3a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d51e16b538c81f008881f4190beebd3a_b.jpg\"><figcaption>第二代，Z高达</figcaption></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5e7e20ea8f2f0ea3a7975297daed82e_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"539\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d9c35addc7c7baefe2551872403d465e_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5e7e20ea8f2f0ea3a7975297daed82e_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='900'%20height='539'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"539\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d9c35addc7c7baefe2551872403d465e_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5e7e20ea8f2f0ea3a7975297daed82e_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5e7e20ea8f2f0ea3a7975297daed82e_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>超人气，高达飞翼零式改</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fbc771a3c7c530963702ef8c20422afb_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"806\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e47b20ea56e9afcbc84612caa03534aa_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fbc771a3c7c530963702ef8c20422afb_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='960'%20height='806'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"806\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e47b20ea56e9afcbc84612caa03534aa_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fbc771a3c7c530963702ef8c20422afb_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fbc771a3c7c530963702ef8c20422afb_b.jpg\"></figure><p>最帅，自由高达</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8fdeeb5bb563bf7b54a9c105cc108c74_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"800\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d60716f19360bc029e73bb257e5fbb1f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8fdeeb5bb563bf7b54a9c105cc108c74_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='800'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"800\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d60716f19360bc029e73bb257e5fbb1f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8fdeeb5bb563bf7b54a9c105cc108c74_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8fdeeb5bb563bf7b54a9c105cc108c74_b.jpg\"></figure><p>最帅最强，强袭自由</p><p></p>", "praise_num": 14, "comments_num": 17, "create_time": "2018-08-16T20:55:19", "update_time": "2018-08-16T20:55:27", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:38.576503"}
