2018-10-04 23:32:41 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:41 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/463536217 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:41 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/463536217 [status:201 request:0.115s]
2018-10-04 23:32:41 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 463536217, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/463536217", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "a701ec2e670014b5cb3c77a1a829a432", "content": "<p>《道经》就像牛顿运动定律，</p><p>告诉你规律是什么；</p><p>《德经》就像辅导教材，</p><p>告诉你如何使用规律解题。</p><p><br></p><p>努不努力是你自己的事</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-08T11:52:10", "update_time": "2018-08-08T11:52:31", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:41.431346"}
