2018-10-04 23:32:41 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:32:41 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/463241541 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:32:41 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/463241541 [status:201 request:0.056s]
