2018-10-04 23:32:41 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 463059808, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/463059808", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "dbaabf0b2ab41a0b191502d4e4a170b1", "content": "<p>努力是儒家思想，知其不可而强为之！</p><p>虚静无为才是道家思想，和其光，同其尘！</p><hr><p>和道家思想背道而驰的“努力”，为什么要写进《道德经》中呢？</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 3, "create_time": "2018-08-07T19:50:39", "update_time": "2018-08-07T19:51:13", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:41.646402"}
