2018-10-04 23:32:49 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 281692979, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/281692979", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "75551bc3a341132b0b1bb672b62f44c5", "content": "对于日本人来说，任何文字都是外来语，而先天的词汇量有比较稀少，引进汉字和引进片假名来说，对日本都是一样的", "praise_num": 13, "comments_num": 18, "create_time": "2017-12-23T18:54:53", "update_time": "2017-12-23T18:54:53", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:49.940881"}
