g+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='720'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4f90db9557a665680a9945b8fbb42633_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4f90db9557a665680a9945b8fbb42633_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4f90db9557a665680a9945b8fbb42633_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='720'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aab7c81b061935d4a28abf95a6c4e492_b.jpg\"></figure><p>结果就是读者通过大老师的眼睛，观察到了一群不说人话只会装B的学生会干部。</p><p>日语里有个说法叫“意識高い”，是一个不能按字面意思理解的贬义词，大意是“<b>表现得</b>非常上进”。其中滥用片假名词汇就是意識高い的罪状之一。</p><p>所以说到底，语言的本质应该还是信息的交流。对于中文母语的使用者，片假名外来语比起能一眼看出意思的汉字单词，自然是学习日语的障碍。反之，英语母语的学习者自然是甘之若饴了。这是屁股决定脑袋的事情。对日本人来说，即使屁股深扎于日本半岛，有些让人看不懂的片假名外来语，依然是毒瘤和装B的具现，还是要拉出来批判的。</p>", "praise_num": 2, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-06-19T22:42:28", "update_time": "2018-06-19T22:42:28", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:32:50.787761"}
