2018-10-04 23:33:15 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:33:15 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/425797476 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:33:15 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/425797476 [status:201 request:0.074s]
2018-10-04 23:33:15 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 425797476, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/425797476", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "a00c145d750b5533679121c2ab5c1546", "content": "<p>看日本动漫的经常会遇到这种情况吧：角色说着说着突然加了一句英语，但重点是，不熟悉日本人发音方式的还真的一下子听不出来那句英语是什么。</p><p>比如festival，节日；有一次我看番时听到的是——费斯堤瓦乐，那一整个下午我都在纠结那是什么，终于最后大概能确定这可能是festival了吧。</p><p>你说他们好好说话不行吗，搞得我天天在那边纠结那是个什么单词。。。。。。</p><p>日本人对外来语的改编真的会让人无所适从TAT</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-06-25T11:27:58", "update_time": "2018-06-25T11:27:58", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:15.465726"}
2018-10-04 23:33:15 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"425797476","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
