2018-10-04 23:33:35 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:33:35 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/471478954 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:33:35 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/471478954 [status:201 request:0.096s]
2018-10-04 23:33:35 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 471478954, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/471478954", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "fe3daefc6868198a7a52f021529bb479", "content": "<p>《道德经》 写给统治者的，</p><p>道德经是集上古先民思想之大成，</p><p>并非偶然，</p><p>看看上古先民怎么造的“为”字，</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cc1898b8a6fad932c20a1a08ab113852_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"628\" data-rawheight=\"206\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3eddb42464d3a2c8e1f7d03f18003728_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"628\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cc1898b8a6fad932c20a1a08ab113852_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='628'%20height='206'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"628\" data-rawheight=\"206\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3eddb42464d3a2c8e1f7d03f18003728_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"628\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cc1898b8a6fad932c20a1a08ab113852_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cc1898b8a6fad932c20a1a08ab113852_b.jpg\"></figure><p>   甲骨文， 很明显是人手在牵一头大象，或者训象，</p><p>   你努力有何用？</p><p> “为”的本意就是做事，用大象比喻自然，社会的力量，</p><p>   人的力量比之太渺小，</p><p>  本意就是强调顺势，顺道，不强求。</p><p>   上古时候人分得很清，干事情是“为”，做东西是“做”。</p><p>   干事情，你只是力量的一小部分，是互动者，参与者。</p><p>    做东西，你拥有力量的全部，你是设计者，控制着。</p><p>    道德经没有“努力”这个概念，因为本就不是说给劳作者的。</p>", "praise_num": 1, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-17T20:12:09", "update_time": "2018-08-17T20:12:09", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:35.465757"}
