2018-10-04 23:33:40 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:33:40 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/416620019 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:33:40 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/416620019 [status:201 request:0.073s]
2018-10-04 23:33:40 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 416620019, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/416620019", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "ca1b51354fb69e6a2a78c6d897828527", "content": "<p>日语本来就是发音语言，不是象形语言。</p><p><br></p><p>那么对一个发音语言为母语的人来说，汉字和片假名哪个好写和简单，那还用说吗？</p><p><br></p><p>说实话，他们没有像韩国那样废除所有的汉字我都觉得他们够遵从传统了。</p>", "praise_num": 3, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-06-13T15:22:49", "update_time": "2018-06-13T15:22:49", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:40.924423"}
