2018-10-04 23:33:43 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 286784853, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/286784853", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "1b76b604e497711c56fd0a6aa7aa95f6", "content": "嗯嗯嗯！<br>我的同事都爱问我:“你来自中国的哪个地区呀？”<br>答曰:“西南。”<br>问:“你们省叫啥名儿呀？”<br>“四川。”<br>“啥？siquan?”(冷漠脸)<br>“我们省有很多熊猫。”<br>“真的吗？我真的超级喜欢熊猫的。我超级想看熊猫的。可惜智利没有。熊猫真的太可爱了。”(一脸满足)<br>然后我就祭出了这个<br><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e0fb317f50b67d8147b02aba5a764ab7_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1278\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1278\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e0fb317f50b67d8147b02aba5a764ab7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1278'%20height='1280'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1278\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1278\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e0fb317f50b67d8147b02aba5a764ab7_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e0fb317f50b67d8147b02aba5a764ab7_b.jpg\"></figure>然后他们就学会了sichuan.还说要去成都看熊猫。<br>靠熊猫教中文的我也是一个好的老师呢！！！", "praise_num": 5944, "comments_num": 137, "create_time": "2018-01-01T10:24:50", "update_time": "2018-01-01T10:24:50", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:43.100714"}
