2018-10-04 23:33:43 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 287489327, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/287489327", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "0", "content": "美剧《女国务卿》有一段剧情，中国在南海填海造陆。<br><br>然后美国一个环保机构为了抗议中国施工中破坏珊瑚礁，于是乎悄悄登岛抗议，然后发现了一个“大阴谋” 。中国人在岛上部署导弹，射程覆盖东南亚所有主要城市。<br><br>中国人为了免予泄密就把这些不请自来的环保人事控制起来，此举引发了美国的强烈不满，逼迫中国放人。比如把航母编队开到中国南海。<br><br>中国人自然不甘示弱，其中一个反击之策就是——把熊猫还给我们。<br><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"379\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9970c62010056c57ad6e194f74ced7fa_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9970c62010056c57ad6e194f74ced7fa_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"379\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='379'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9970c62010056c57ad6e194f74ced7fa_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-9970c62010056c57ad6e194f74ced7fa_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"380\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a23f0d2d62922d2afdf06e2ac8bb8205_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a23f0d2d62922d2afdf06e2ac8bb8205_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"380\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='380'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a23f0d2d62922d2afdf06e2ac8bb8205_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a23f0d2d62922d2afdf06e2ac8bb8205_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"432\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-eb76396801e60315dab3fc70a64143fe_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-eb76396801e60315dab3fc70a64143fe_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"432\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='432'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-eb76396801e60315dab3fc70a64143fe_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-eb76396801e60315dab3fc70a64143fe_b.jpg\"></figure><br>有人分析了如果熊猫被中国要回去，将会引发巨大的舆论风波，甚至于影响美国大选结果。<br><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"415\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9e3b72f7a6910f09023fc7963c1e1dcd_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9e3b72f7a6910f09023fc7963c1e1dcd_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"415\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='415'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9e3b72f7a6910f09023fc7963c1e1dcd_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9e3b72f7a6910f09023fc7963c1e1dcd_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"469\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3a080974032d1ccb1b7fde9ecc5e8876_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3a080974032d1ccb1b7fde9ecc5e8876_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"469\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='469'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3a080974032d1ccb1b7fde9ecc5e8876_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3a080974032d1ccb1b7fde9ecc5e8876_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"387\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-71c464b0e5a7e694676c0144bb3c3655_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-71c464b0e5a7e694676c0144bb3c3655_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"387\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='387'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-71c464b0e5a7e694676c0144bb3c3655_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-71c464b0e5a7e694676c0144bb3c3655_b.jpg\"></figure><br>最后是美国人恢复了环保团体网站的服务器，找到了中国人部署导弹的证据，于是立刻就强硬起来，表示熊猫是不可能还的，这辈子都不可能还。<br><figure><noscript><img data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"336\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-34b04d56f6e15ce7b29a1562c16cf2eb_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-34b04d56f6e15ce7b29a1562c16cf2eb_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"336\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='336'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-34b04d56f6e15ce7b29a1562c16cf2eb_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-34b04d56f6e15ce7b29a1562c16cf2eb_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 17967, "comments_num": 964, "create_time": "2018-01-02T12:46:50", "update_time": "2018-01-02T12:46:51", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:43.730771"}
