2018-10-04 23:33:43 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 275278821, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/275278821", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "37b9604b6e0b4f750588db301199d497", "content": "<figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"238\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4220f81762aef6afc230bdf9cab5d81e_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"332\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"332\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"238\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='332'%20height='238'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"332\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"332\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4220f81762aef6afc230bdf9cab5d81e_b.jpg\"></figure><br><br>这是我于2011年在成都大熊猫繁育研究基地拍摄的照片。<br><br>某次聊到大熊猫，我把这张照片给一个美国同事看。一个50多岁的老头，立刻变成少女风，说“Awww（就是情景喜剧里观众有起伏的哦～～）they were hugging.\" （这个地方原来用的是Oh，经过评论里几个大神指教，应该是awww, 感谢。）<br><br>所以，是的，确实喜欢。", "praise_num": 11451, "comments_num": 278, "create_time": "2017-12-13T00:30:57", "update_time": "2018-02-01T19:41:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:43.827311"}
