2018-10-04 23:33:44 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/308895170 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:33:44 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/308895170 [status:201 request:0.195s]
2018-10-04 23:33:44 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 308895170, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/308895170", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "d5dc5ef604da7cfa118d84b57ca674bc", "content": "<p><b>有一股黑白旋风，来自东方的神秘力量，让外国民众欲罢不能！</b> </p><p>你可能还不知道，中国大熊猫出国后的待遇简直是逆天！当年美国民众冒着暴雪依依送别“泰山”；</p><p>熊猫宝宝夭折，日本民众悲怆痛心，擦着鼻涕眼泪纷纷赶来追悼；</p><p>为了获得熊猫的租赁权，英国政府卧薪尝胆用了五年的时间才如愿以偿；</p><p>送到国外的熊猫都是专机接送、入住豪华寝宫、竹子稍不新鲜都入不了它们的法眼...... </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"264\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='264'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"264\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f0bc57afe49616892cc2650db92c577c_b.gif\"></figure><p>这个磨人的小妖精，任凭你是抠脚大汉、邻家大婶儿、隔壁老王，上至九十九，下到刚会走的，统统都会被其五短三粗的身材、眨巴眨巴的小黑眼睛萌一脸。<b>能做的也就是跪拜臣服，打开手机开启“云撸滚滚”模式。</b></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-61515b09187785c47190dab430ebc9b5_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"225\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-61515b09187785c47190dab430ebc9b5_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"400\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='225'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"225\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-61515b09187785c47190dab430ebc9b5_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"400\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-61515b09187785c47190dab430ebc9b5_b.gif\"></figure><p>但其实外表呆萌的滚滚可是个练家子！巨大的咬合力仅次于北极熊，和棕熊不相上下（别忘了滚滚的学名叫大<b>熊</b>猫）；一口气爬20多米的树根本不费劲儿，都不带喘的；如果滚滚兽性大发施展起拳脚，摆平三四只狼不在话下。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-112919ba6593e2c79bc6643958e2dbfe_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"236\" data-rawheight=\"170\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-112919ba6593e2c79bc6643958e2dbfe_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"236\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='236'%20height='170'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"236\" data-rawheight=\"170\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-112919ba6593e2c79bc6643958e2dbfe_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"236\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-112919ba6593e2c79bc6643958e2dbfe_b.gif\"></figure><p>哎，滚滚明明可以靠实力吃饭闯江湖，<b>左踢南山凶老虎，右打北海大灰狼，</b>却偏偏要靠颜值卖萌为生。时而温顺乖巧像天使，时而发疯癫狂小恶魔，这就是熊孩子本人啊！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bcc41487fe86908e6322ce776af91b7e_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"328\" data-rawheight=\"186\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bcc41487fe86908e6322ce776af91b7e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"328\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='328'%20height='186'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"328\" data-rawheight=\"186\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bcc41487fe86908e6322ce776af91b7e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"328\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-bcc41487fe86908e6322ce776af91b7e_b.gif\"></figure><p>总而言之言而总之，大熊猫已经坐稳我天朝国宝的第一咖位啦。</p><p><br></p><p><b>中国拥有世界上全部大熊猫的所有权</b>，外国动物园可以申请从中国租借大熊猫进行合作研究，但是要遵守很多条约，比如：</p><p><br></p><blockquote>一对亚成体大熊猫（离开父母独立生活，还未性成熟）的租借期通常为10年，一年租金为<b>100万美金</b>。如果熊猫在出借期生下小滚滚，每年的租金要再增加<b>60万美元</b>，两年后长大了的小滚滚要交还给中国。若大熊猫意外死亡，承接方要接受<b>50万美元的罚款</b>，遗体也要归中方所有。当然，这些资金都会用于支持中国的大熊猫保护工作。</blockquote><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"428\" data-rawheight=\"240\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"428\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='428'%20height='240'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"428\" data-rawheight=\"240\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"428\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46c262a4e9fa9be93e4c832f857dd614_b.gif\"></figure><p><b>靠！这完全就是不平等条约啊！</b>但，很多国家对这个霸王条款可都是求之不得，眼巴巴地等着呢。嗯......抱抱自己，总会有熊猫的！ </p><p><br></p><p><b>－来自各国动物园，痛并快乐的吐槽－</b></p><p><br></p><p>北美大熊猫保护基金的负责人就曾“抱怨”，比滚滚租金更贵的是日常伺候小主子们的费用。不仅要聘用专业的饲养员还要付医疗检查的费用，而且滚滚的食量惊人还挑剔，竹子的口感差一点都不吃！<b>这熊孩子，每年的花销轻轻松松破100万美元</b></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"438\" data-rawheight=\"220\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"438\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='438'%20height='220'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"438\" data-rawheight=\"220\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"438\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-946de8601c250cfcb3c0ebb421d1fc5a_b.gif\"></figure><p>说到竹子，爱丁堡动物园也有话要说。甜甜和阳光每年都会吃掉价值约10万多美元的进口竹子。<b>这还不算“惨”，毕竟钱能解决的就不是问题。</b>美国一家动物园的滚滚干脆把所有的竹子都吃干净了，他们只能连忙寻求竹子捐赠。人类再怎么难，也不能让滚滚饿肚子啊！ </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-acf21738435b851ae0c378477a4a2f7f_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"365\" data-rawheight=\"205\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-acf21738435b851ae0c378477a4a2f7f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"365\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='365'%20height='205'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"365\" data-rawheight=\"205\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-acf21738435b851ae0c378477a4a2f7f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"365\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-acf21738435b851ae0c378477a4a2f7f_b.gif\"></figure><p>不过竹子被吃精光怎么说也算是件好事，说明滚滚在新环境适应的很快，相当认可当地的伙食。<b>总觉得这类抱怨就是娇嗔地邀功，动物园在求各国媒体的表扬和小红花～</b>日本长野动物园所经历的，才是真正的浩劫。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-982518d1c41794fc3930bd2f855e675d_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"284\" data-rawheight=\"198\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-982518d1c41794fc3930bd2f855e675d_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"284\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='284'%20height='198'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"284\" data-rawheight=\"198\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-982518d1c41794fc3930bd2f855e675d_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"284\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-982518d1c41794fc3930bd2f855e675d_b.gif\"></figure><p>2002年东京上野动物园的珍珍产下了一只熊猫宝宝。这一“天雷滚滚”的喜讯让动物园和当地民众都非常兴奋，纷纷为小滚滚举行各种庆祝活动。但世事难料，不到一周小滚滚不幸夭折了。上野动物园园长在新闻直播中痛哭流涕地道歉，民众也为此感到万分惋惜。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-ec713e5db98be3b5159722325db85f06_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"300\" data-rawheight=\"390\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"300\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='300'%20height='390'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"300\" data-rawheight=\"390\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"300\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-ec713e5db98be3b5159722325db85f06_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3d1d588280978aee9246ffaa6a9aed9_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"300\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"300\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='300'%20height='420'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"300\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"300\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e3d1d588280978aee9246ffaa6a9aed9_b.jpg\"></figure><p>要知道这并不是园长第一次落泪。据说当年上野动物园欣喜万分地迎来两只熊猫之后，第二天园长到滚滚的屋子一看，差点吓倒在地上，<b>因为少了一只！</b>一夜之间竟然丢了一只熊猫？！馆长觉得自己犯了弥天大罪，晚节不保啊！ </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-18b59d8103f58dfca0bf1a42308535b2_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"245\" data-rawheight=\"150\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-18b59d8103f58dfca0bf1a42308535b2_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"245\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='245'%20height='150'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"245\" data-rawheight=\"150\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-18b59d8103f58dfca0bf1a42308535b2_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"245\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-18b59d8103f58dfca0bf1a42308535b2_b.gif\"></figure><p>就在他仰天长叹之际，一歪眼睛竟然看到那只密室失踪的滚滚正扒在铁栏杆上，一副“还不快把朕抱下来”的样子。园长连忙三步并两步接驾滚滚，随后两行热泪涓涓地流出眼眶，<b>不禁感叹：世间最幸福的事，就是失而复得啊～</b> </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"335\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='335'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"335\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-53cf0f212e0aa0863f1f00572c75bba7_b.gif\"></figure><p><b>－滚滚各国寻访大事记－</b></p><p><br></p><p>滚滚出访可都是最高领导级别的待遇，甚至更加高B格，接待的国家都是小心翼翼唯恐自己做得不够好......</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-01a3f8d994a11f8eac7e8fb1bcd72a5a_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"800\" data-rawheight=\"499\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"800\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-01a3f8d994a11f8eac7e8fb1bcd72a5a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='800'%20height='499'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"800\" data-rawheight=\"499\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"800\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-01a3f8d994a11f8eac7e8fb1bcd72a5a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-01a3f8d994a11f8eac7e8fb1bcd72a5a_b.jpg\"></figure><p><b>荷兰</b></p><p><br></p><p>就在今年四月，星雅和武雯乘坐涂有专属名字和头像的专机，抵达荷兰。落地之后也享受了帝王级的待遇，数百家国际媒体齐聚机场等候，接机的粉丝们高举印着滚滚头像的旗帜夹道欢迎，民众们更是在市区的每一条街道上都插满了黑白的熊猫旗。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ce36f7d081d55f63ecd4d9bd23cf329d_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"620\" data-rawheight=\"413\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"620\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ce36f7d081d55f63ecd4d9bd23cf329d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='620'%20height='413'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"620\" data-rawheight=\"413\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"620\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ce36f7d081d55f63ecd4d9bd23cf329d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ce36f7d081d55f63ecd4d9bd23cf329d_b.jpg\"></figure><p><b>比利时</b> </p><p><br></p><p>“比利时人疯了，完全疯了！”天堂动物园园长在星徽和好好抵达时发出这个感慨。当天所有人、所有媒体无一不在谈论大熊猫，比利时总理吕波更是亲自接机。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0db9ec7cca5e8ed5c22a12a0b8844e99_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"980\" data-rawheight=\"674\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"980\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0db9ec7cca5e8ed5c22a12a0b8844e99_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='980'%20height='674'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"980\" data-rawheight=\"674\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"980\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0db9ec7cca5e8ed5c22a12a0b8844e99_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0db9ec7cca5e8ed5c22a12a0b8844e99_b.jpg\"></figure><p>在此之前，天堂动物园想为滚滚们办一个隆重的欢迎仪式，在网上刚刚发出的邀请函，不到一天的时间就收到了万余人的申请。迫于名额限制，园方不得不向落选者致歉：I am soooooo sorry 啦</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-1fd8a9f5f77b5b0ac8528ef5ae600c3e_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"378\" data-rawheight=\"241\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-1fd8a9f5f77b5b0ac8528ef5ae600c3e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"378\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='378'%20height='241'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"378\" data-rawheight=\"241\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-1fd8a9f5f77b5b0ac8528ef5ae600c3e_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"378\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-1fd8a9f5f77b5b0ac8528ef5ae600c3e_b.gif\"></figure><p><b>德国</b></p><p><br></p><p>柏林动物园的园长说，这是他第一次为两只动物举办如此隆重的欢迎仪式。柏林勃兰登堡电视台也在当天顺应民意，做了迎接大熊猫的现场直播。不过这一切都是值得的，因为“看到大熊猫，我的心都融化了”。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-269d1ab908da27ae487fa9eb269e695c_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"473\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"700\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-269d1ab908da27ae487fa9eb269e695c_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='700'%20height='473'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"473\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"700\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-269d1ab908da27ae487fa9eb269e695c_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-269d1ab908da27ae487fa9eb269e695c_b.jpg\"></figure><p><b>英国</b></p><p><br></p><p>天天和阳光当年抵达苏格兰的阵势也是超级隆重的，除了动物园的工作人员外，英国政府苏格兰事务大臣、苏格兰地方分权政府副总理、爱丁堡市荣誉市长以及中国驻当地领事馆代表均前往机场接驾。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bff23d5596ffe723fbe3f6021e79e354_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"542\" data-rawheight=\"360\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"542\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bff23d5596ffe723fbe3f6021e79e354_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='542'%20height='360'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"542\" data-rawheight=\"360\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"542\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bff23d5596ffe723fbe3f6021e79e354_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bff23d5596ffe723fbe3f6021e79e354_b.jpg\"></figure><p>在苏格兰公投期间还曾有过一个亦真亦假的段子：如果苏格兰独立了，那么两只滚滚就要归还给英国。很多苏格兰民众对此很痛心，放出狠话：<b>你可以夺去我的自由，但不能夺走我的熊猫！</b> </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3f325482af81c0f36ba8b3a854337fe7_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"332\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3f325482af81c0f36ba8b3a854337fe7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='332'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"332\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3f325482af81c0f36ba8b3a854337fe7_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3f325482af81c0f36ba8b3a854337fe7_b.jpg\"></figure><p><b>－滚滚的外国“皇宫”－</b></p><p><br></p><p>在各国拿号、排队终于获得租赁大熊猫的名额、签署完“不平等条约”、隆重的完成接机仪式之后，这只是成为“滚滚奴”的前期工作。<b>滚滚住哪儿？吃啥？平时谁来伺候？生病了谁来把脉开药？算好发情生娃的好日子没有？......</b></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c3be2ced149f3d930ba1e4b659540509_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"225\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c3be2ced149f3d930ba1e4b659540509_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"400\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='225'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"225\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c3be2ced149f3d930ba1e4b659540509_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"400\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c3be2ced149f3d930ba1e4b659540509_b.gif\"></figure><p>就拿荷兰这次熊猫陛下登基仪式来说吧，可是足足花了5100万！在星雅和武雯抵达之前，荷兰就开始为它俩修建皇宫。为了保持中国风的原汁原味，让滚滚们不想家每天毫无压力地吃竹子卖萌，建筑工人都是从中国选拔后送过去。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6b8f92ccd6ea2f45918612806eeea27f_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"974\" data-rawheight=\"657\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"974\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6b8f92ccd6ea2f45918612806eeea27f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='974'%20height='657'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"974\" data-rawheight=\"657\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"974\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6b8f92ccd6ea2f45918612806eeea27f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6b8f92ccd6ea2f45918612806eeea27f_b.jpg\"></figure><p>比利时的天堂动物园也是开辟出了5300平米的熊猫领地，星徽和好好各有超过120平米的卧室，还有专门的医务室、育婴室、饲养员的房间、调度室、食物储存室等一切必不可少的配套设施。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-619b78584ff0275fabfd197140f4b14d_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"440\" data-rawheight=\"294\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"440\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-619b78584ff0275fabfd197140f4b14d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='440'%20height='294'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"440\" data-rawheight=\"294\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"440\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-619b78584ff0275fabfd197140f4b14d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-619b78584ff0275fabfd197140f4b14d_b.jpg\"></figure><p>德国那边，为了保证梦梦和娇庆在柏林生活舒畅，柏林市动物园斥资1000万欧元修建了占地近5500平方米的“熊猫园”。熊猫园富有中国特色，除了大片绿地和攀爬设施，还开挖出一条人工小溪。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-619aed8f515b0085620f6176b70b0dd2_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"720\" data-rawheight=\"474\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"720\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-619aed8f515b0085620f6176b70b0dd2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='720'%20height='474'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"720\" data-rawheight=\"474\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"720\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-619aed8f515b0085620f6176b70b0dd2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-619aed8f515b0085620f6176b70b0dd2_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-501389e0864b0ad2f9f446137d3f7cb3_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"261\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"400\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='261'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"261\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"400\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-501389e0864b0ad2f9f446137d3f7cb3_b.jpg\"></figure><p>再来说英国，为使天天和阳光能尽快坠入爱河，爱丁堡动物园特地开支25万英镑为它们打造了舒适豪华的新家。要知道这可是经过五年的漫长谈判，才终于把大熊猫请到苏格兰。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-84e2832b22cd5ca1326c76b33c041656_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"375\" data-rawheight=\"259\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-84e2832b22cd5ca1326c76b33c041656_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"375\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='375'%20height='259'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"375\" data-rawheight=\"259\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-84e2832b22cd5ca1326c76b33c041656_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"375\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-84e2832b22cd5ca1326c76b33c041656_b.gif\"></figure><p>不过进驻了爱丁堡动物园的滚滚们依旧没让人省心，好几次假孕让英国人民的心情就像过山车一样。<b>这种待遇也只有他们关心凯特王妃是否怀孕，生男生女时才会有吧。</b> </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8f6a930a9b22373cd5361c8d3dfe5c47_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"695\" data-rawheight=\"487\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"695\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8f6a930a9b22373cd5361c8d3dfe5c47_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='695'%20height='487'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"695\" data-rawheight=\"487\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"695\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8f6a930a9b22373cd5361c8d3dfe5c47_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8f6a930a9b22373cd5361c8d3dfe5c47_b.jpg\"></figure><p>滚滚都是一对对儿地送到国外，除了卖萌吃竹子之外，它们可是肩负着延续香火，传宗接代的使命！每个承接的国家和动物园都会对此抱以超高的期待～ </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"447\" data-rawheight=\"238\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"447\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='447'%20height='238'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"447\" data-rawheight=\"238\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"447\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2a33aa266e2ebbd82b0688c2188122eb_b.gif\"></figure><p><b>－滚滚的餐饮料理－</b></p><p><br></p><p>住得再好，也比不过那一捆捆鲜美多汁的竹子。滚滚吃货的名号可不是江湖谣传浪得虚名，它们一天能吃50多公斤竹子嘞！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c37412047801a23df263a9d01fdec973_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"356\" data-rawheight=\"200\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c37412047801a23df263a9d01fdec973_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"356\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='356'%20height='200'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"356\" data-rawheight=\"200\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c37412047801a23df263a9d01fdec973_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"356\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c37412047801a23df263a9d01fdec973_b.gif\"></figure><p>美国亚特兰大市的动物园，就曾为雅伦和喜伦的口粮而发愁，于是就动员当地一千多户居民在自家院子为滚滚种竹子。当地居民当然也是非常配合，即使在恶劣的天气也会把滚滚的口粮送到动物园。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c56cd7529cc0a4468272271d8485acb9_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"245\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c56cd7529cc0a4468272271d8485acb9_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"400\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='245'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"245\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c56cd7529cc0a4468272271d8485acb9_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"400\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c56cd7529cc0a4468272271d8485acb9_b.gif\"></figure><p>柏林动物园很自觉地认为本地的竹子不太鲜美，所以滚滚吃的竹子都是从荷兰运来的。另外他们还给滚滚加一些用面粉、燕麦片和花生油特制而成的“熊猫面包”。 </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-02545b56641eb4072daa419e8d17b00f_b.gif\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"356\" data-rawheight=\"200\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-02545b56641eb4072daa419e8d17b00f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"356\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='356'%20height='200'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"356\" data-rawheight=\"200\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-02545b56641eb4072daa419e8d17b00f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"356\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-02545b56641eb4072daa419e8d17b00f_b.gif\"></figure><p><b>2017年9月13日亚运会吉祥物“盼盼”的原型，传奇大熊猫巴斯在福州去世，享年37岁，相当于100多岁的老人。</b> </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc33a77390579748fccd946df8b02963_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"632\" data-rawheight=\"344\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"632\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc33a77390579748fccd946df8b02963_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='632'%20height='344'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"632\" data-rawheight=\"344\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"632\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc33a77390579748fccd946df8b02963_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc33a77390579748fccd946df8b02963_b.jpg\"></figure><p>巴斯是一只多才多艺的大熊猫，会骑车、投篮、举重、上过春晚、也曾作为和平使者访美。美国民众为了<b>看它3分钟，不惜排队5小时</b>！更可贵的是，“盼盼”曾为异种克隆大熊猫捐赠了体细胞，还是个多子多孙的熊猫奶奶呢。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-264d2a7d668787bf0a72387130d1d4c4_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"690\" data-rawheight=\"426\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"690\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-264d2a7d668787bf0a72387130d1d4c4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='690'%20height='426'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"690\" data-rawheight=\"426\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"690\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-264d2a7d668787bf0a72387130d1d4c4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-264d2a7d668787bf0a72387130d1d4c4_b.jpg\"></figure><p>如今，熊猫滚滚已经成为了世界级的网红A咖，一出生就是“熊生赢家”。那些出了国的大熊猫过的都还不错，应该说是特别特别好！巴斯奶奶大可以放心的去了。</p><p>文 | 无二之旅</p><p>图 | 网络</p><hr><p>欢迎关注：</p><p>知乎机构号：<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/org/wu-er-zhi-lv/activities\" class=\"internal\">无二之旅</a></p><p>知乎专栏：<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/UNIQUEWAY\" class=\"internal\">无二之旅</a>（不走寻常路de小众海外自由行攻略）</p><p>微信公众号：无二之旅（每天推送海外小众目的地旅行图文）</p>", "praise_num": 11884, "comments_num": 229, "create_time": "2018-02-01T14:07:28", "update_time": "2018-03-26T14:12:52", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:44.305009"}
