2018-10-04 23:33:45 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 21556663, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/21556663", "question_id": 22494395, "author_id": "add3d5f9738c2c2e898fbd64de3d2b3b", "content": "阶段性问题，一个市场不可能永远都不规范。成王败寇啊！目前就是这样。", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 1, "create_time": "2014-01-11T00:28:47", "update_time": "2014-01-11T00:28:47", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:45.221556"}
