2018-10-04 23:33:58 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 476372555, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/476372555", "question_id": 290129514, "author_id": "009145edcffc08e977bd2eda7c974e06", "content": "<p>难道没有人觉得是我们国产四驱车系列啥的吗？像什么战龙四驱啊，雷速登闪电重线啥的，每次播完都有貌似都有主持人介绍动画心新出场的赛车，一顿猛夸。钻石双冠，我的伙伴～</p><p><br></p><p>悠悠球系列像火力少年王，感觉也有很浓重的产品推销意味。</p><p><br></p><p>但我不得不说，童年的时候，战龙四驱里面的韦天飞，火力少年王里的姚杰，可把我帅惨了，和南宫问天共同称霸童年男神top前三。</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a06c502cc06077a0920a5fe5da5ca51d_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-08571700dceb9e61a5323e614197a0c3_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"320\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='320'%20height='320'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-08571700dceb9e61a5323e614197a0c3_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"320\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a06c502cc06077a0920a5fe5da5ca51d_b.jpg\"></figure><p>                    阿飞伪装身份“X”</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-24bc6f23444d4abd713b542d13d60da1_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-160ac667d454d96c956f1d529242658f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"320\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='320'%20height='320'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-160ac667d454d96c956f1d529242658f_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"320\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-24bc6f23444d4abd713b542d13d60da1_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c21b9055bc134b9737cde2026783c91e_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a835a0f15f6354626984a5685a8efd26_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"320\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='320'%20height='320'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a835a0f15f6354626984a5685a8efd26_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"320\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c21b9055bc134b9737cde2026783c91e_b.jpg\"></figure><p>                           恢复真实身份</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-180a5e53ab0e36a9825fcb5bf800fe85_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6afa25769522ba9042daf4c2a92a54de_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"320\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='320'%20height='320'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"320\" data-rawheight=\"320\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6afa25769522ba9042daf4c2a92a54de_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"320\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-180a5e53ab0e36a9825fcb5bf800fe85_b.jpg\"></figure><p>                      可爱的队长姚杰</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>就算是产品推销我也认了，谁要他们是我童年闪亮亮的光呢，况且</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>我看了也不买啊～</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-23T22:53:21", "update_time": "2018-08-23T22:53:21", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:58.480045"}
