2018-10-04 23:33:58 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 476289961, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/476289961", "question_id": 290129514, "author_id": "7dcabe94ddc0cd16cabfa65f40a89fcf", "content": "<p>没人说《高达创战者》么？业界文明的大型机（模）战（型）动（广）画（告）。剧情上来讲，前两部还用点心，有点硬核运动番的意思（而且还有学姐，笑）。然而最近的《高达创形者》剧情真心挺白开水的。</p><p>然而，重点是，机体帅啊，脑洞大啊</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-89989744dc7671b7681dbe3065bad62e_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"417\" data-rawheight=\"661\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d0bfec8d462253a93b01745c1badb979_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"417\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='417'%20height='661'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"417\" data-rawheight=\"661\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d0bfec8d462253a93b01745c1badb979_b.jpg\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"417\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-89989744dc7671b7681dbe3065bad62e_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e1ca0682cf33156eb9281b5c628777cf_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"719\" data-rawheight=\"577\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-52b9115e030ca4ba92667efc3c248f18_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"719\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e1ca0682cf33156eb9281b5c628777cf_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='719'%20height='577'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"719\" data-rawheight=\"577\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-52b9115e030ca4ba92667efc3c248f18_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"719\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e1ca0682cf33156eb9281b5c628777cf_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"http