b1ba6_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-6a5b275abfa73b94f5aff308891b1ba6_b.jpg\"></figure><p>创战者，seed等等的质量都很高啊！</p><p>后来我看了创形者，这才是真的水！剧情略显zz，对战少还水，燃点呢？！</p><p>为了卖胶，万代已经不择手段了！</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-21T07:43:22", "update_time": "2018-08-21T07:43:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:33:59.738575"}
