2018-10-04 23:34:05 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:34:05 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/275506561 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:34:05 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/275506561 [status:201 request:0.005s]
2018-10-04 23:34:05 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 275506561, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/275506561", "question_id": 263956454, "author_id": "a72b54f1cdfadc02f1d8a2fd112e9589", "content": "<p>把宿舍装修成塔达林风格并不难，你只需要一些墙纸和小装饰</p><p>难的是在这之后</p><p>如果你的舍友向你邪魅一笑：“拉克希尔仪式胜负已分，我才是高阶领主”</p><p>怎么避免被他从楼上丢下去</p>", "praise_num": 4, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2017-12-13T13:13:18", "update_time": "2017-12-13T13:13:19", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:05.956210"}
