2018-10-04 23:34:08 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 490549192, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/490549192", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "ebc9dce5f41dab98e4a84e14738c2518", "content": "<p>因为中国人拥有庞大的汉字认知量以及远超日本人的汉字理解力才会觉得外来概念翻译成汉字比翻译成假名好。</p><p></p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-13T08:27:52", "update_time": "2018-09-13T08:27:52", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:08.487716"}
