2018-10-04 23:34:11 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 408258522, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/408258522", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "2ce4a516962af208c299f1e3f8d04c52", "content": "<figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-45af47a810f42e5911c335e8f6651ab3_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"969\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-0511c8071f34847a58e06789b34bcee7_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"969\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-45af47a810f42e5911c335e8f6651ab3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='969'%20height='640'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"969\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-0511c8071f34847a58e06789b34bcee7_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"969\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-45af47a810f42e5911c335e8f6651ab3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-45af47a810f42e5911c335e8f6651ab3_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e9ba0b2eb73775626bafb855f83bdb9b_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b5093932f786c23890f77a31700459d8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e9ba0b2eb73775626bafb855f83bdb9b_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='960'%20height='640'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b5093932f786c23890f77a31700459d8_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e9ba0b2eb73775626bafb855f83bdb9b_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e9ba0b2eb73775626bafb855f83bdb9b_b.jpg\"></figure><p>我们家每次出国游，必定会带十多个熊猫的小玩偶，真是神挡杀神，佛挡杀佛，完全不能抗拒。</p><p>1. 土耳其番红花城，当时看到两个小朋友很有礼貌，就送了两个给他们，结果他们的大胡子爸爸看到后，一定要回赠我们礼物，给了我们一袋大概十多斤的大榛子，好大的那种。，还一定要和我们合影，照片正中间，两孩子捧着熊猫幸福的样子。。</p><p>2. 土耳其格雷梅，洞穴旅馆的大胡子老板，走的时候送给老板一个玩偶，老板开心的回赠了我们一瓶红酒，并抱着我的小朋友照相。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca69bad348f91fe4f5c407d753c87370_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1365\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-37ff9a55d2105062e6f89663f7e70aca_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca69bad348f91fe4f5c407d753c87370_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1365'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1365\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-37ff9a55d2105062e6f89663f7e70aca_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca69bad348f91fe4f5c407d753c87370_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca69bad348f91fe4f5c407d753c87370_b.jpg\"></figure><p>3. 土耳其去伊斯坦布尔路上，超速一点，被交警拦住了，看了是中国人，又一车很多美女，就大度的放了，送了他一个玩偶，旁边其它警察都围过来，可惜当时没有多的了。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4f82c12bcc5c38a72a124971037267e6_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1536\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-66e37847304e1f2347df5fc8788f0fab_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4f82c12bcc5c38a72a124971037267e6_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1536'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1536\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-66e37847304e1f2347df5fc8788f0fab_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4f82c12bcc5c38a72a124971037267e6_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-4f82c12bcc5c38a72a124971037267e6_b.jpg\"></figure><p>4 冰岛住民宿，要走的时候留了一个玩偶在客厅，给老板说了，他专门邮件感谢我们，说他儿子非常喜欢熊猫</p><p>5.冰岛东部峡湾小镇，当时一行九人，只定了一个房子（因为有两人是后来加入），一个房子只能住七人，我本来准备安顿好七人之后，我和LD到旁边去找和酒店，老板是个慈祥老爷爷，也送了个熊猫，开心啊，他说，他住他老房子去，我们可以自由支配他的两栋别墅（booking上只能订一栋），而且价格不按两栋算，另外两个人按照一栋的七分之二价格算。</p><p>6. 新西兰牧羊人教堂旁天文台，上山前有个收费站，一个小妹妹很好心告诉我们说，现在是下午四点半了，五点就要关闭天文台了，让我们明天来可能时间更宽裕，因为那天也是农历新年，我们就送了个玩偶，她激动的快哭了。</p><p>7. 更多的例如饭店，送玩偶会开心的多送一份水果，景点小妹妹会送小朋友一个纪念品，这种太多了。</p><p>熊猫是打通中外隔阂的利器，每次出行必带。。</p><p>========以下是补充========</p><p>第一次在知乎回答收到这么多赞，感谢啊。有知友要合照，这个要回去翻。</p><p>8. 土耳其小朋友带了一件熊猫装，在伊斯坦布尔和阿拉恰特穿过，好多人来摸啊。后面有照片。</p><p>9.在伊斯坦布尔老皇宫，我和LD在边走边谈论，一个日本旅行团的老伯凑上来，用不错的中文说他去过中国，喜欢九寨沟，然后我也随手送了一个玩偶给他，看得出他非常高兴。</p><p>10. 现在出去，介绍自己时，说来自中国四川成都，对方只会报以程序式的笑脸，后面我们再加一句熊猫的故乡，表情立刻就变化了，感觉好开心。</p><p>11.新西兰但尼丁，公园有一群人在地上用粉笔涂画，很开心的聚会，然后小朋友也一起加入，最后我们送给一个很老的老人家一个玩偶，他开心的像个小孩，说这是他收到的最美丽的礼物。</p><p>================================</p><p>有很多朋友想看看我买的玩偶是啥样，我也是淘宝选的，太贵了自己也不会买一般就选十块以内一个的，又还做的不难看的。</p><p>这种玩偶自带夹子，可以夹在条状物体上，做工还行吧。</p><p>淘宝链接我在评论里有写，就不一一回答了，我不是淘主，只是自己买过，用过，觉得还可以。淘宝也有很多其它熊猫玩偶，都不错的。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9a481fece6220fe1317ca7ed793b9f65_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1486\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-012a23a07e4de92db831159df1b1caf3_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9a481fece6220fe1317ca7ed793b9f65_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1486'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1486\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-012a23a07e4de92db831159df1b1caf3_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9a481fece6220fe1317ca7ed793b9f65_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9a481fece6220fe1317ca7ed793b9f65_b.jpg\"></figure><p>================================</p><p>看到评论数上500，高兴啊，找到了交警那张照片补充，也找了一些其它照片以飨观众。。。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f1448128ac80720ab507b982a2515b9_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2228\" data-rawheight=\"1253\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b5dec14e480f70da4ed30abc49eae451_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2228\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f1448128ac80720ab507b982a2515b9_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2228'%20height='1253'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2228\" data-rawheight=\"1253\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b5dec14e480f70da4ed30abc49eae451_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2228\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f1448128ac80720ab507b982a2515b9_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4f1448128ac80720ab507b982a2515b9_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b5fd66832c5f04d086a278cf4191e1cb_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1289\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-63160526414fbefbad9f37494118408d_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1289\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b5fd66832c5f04d086a278cf4191e1cb_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1289'%20height='2048'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1289\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-63160526414fbefbad9f37494118408d_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1289\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b5fd66832c5f04d086a278cf4191e1cb_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b5fd66832c5f04d086a278cf4191e1cb_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d2cfa8e1a1746ce431a14bca777461fa_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1354\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-98d7d47a13d0d5368d58861305f1009a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d2cfa8e1a1746ce431a14bca777461fa_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1354'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1354\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-98d7d47a13d0d5368d58861305f1009a_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d2cfa8e1a1746ce431a14bca777461fa_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d2cfa8e1a1746ce431a14bca777461fa_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f281a5add14a1a52529fa42bc1d411f8_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1365\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3fb19b680cf6ed6ee556a0333af80256_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1365\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f281a5add14a1a52529fa42bc1d411f8_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1365'%20height='2048'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1365\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3fb19b680cf6ed6ee556a0333af80256_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1365\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f281a5add14a1a52529fa42bc1d411f8_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f281a5add14a1a52529fa42bc1d411f8_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0f0bb81ac665a0c44a68ed09646a6a3a_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1365\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-bec9f769cfc381b394e156918225b7c3_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0f0bb81ac665a0c44a68ed09646a6a3a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1365'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1365\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-bec9f769cfc381b394e156918225b7c3_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0f0bb81ac665a0c44a68ed09646a6a3a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-0f0bb81ac665a0c44a68ed09646a6a3a_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-252d30adaecd15b7c49c4a068e6e7b96_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"2098\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-627227a72c873ef451bfbb84958fad3b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-252d30adaecd15b7c49c4a068e6e7b96_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='2098'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"2098\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-627227a72c873ef451bfbb84958fad3b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-252d30adaecd15b7c49c4a068e6e7b96_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-252d30adaecd15b7c49c4a068e6e7b96_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aa073e467a5ae0cf5cecbf85ff59b596_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1536\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-624e114b9ea60dda7f135e290e57f704_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aa073e467a5ae0cf5cecbf85ff59b596_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1536'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1536\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-624e114b9ea60dda7f135e290e57f704_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aa073e467a5ae0cf5cecbf85ff59b596_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-aa073e467a5ae0cf5cecbf85ff59b596_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 3670, "comments_num": 215, "create_time": "2018-06-03T13:31:21", "update_time": "2018-07-02T20:28:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:11.540789"}
