2018-10-04 23:34:12 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 284386492, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/284386492", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "551f255a471d6f7be8de0902ce4a10f5", "content": "本人广告狗一枚，在上营销课的时候老师就讲过关于cctv占据facebook一方席位的原因<br><br>就是因为我们的滚滚啊！！<br><br><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"512\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a09921c35a80552a2c7a59fb27f15537_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"512\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"512\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a09921c35a80552a2c7a59fb27f15537_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"512\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='512'%20height='512'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"512\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"512\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a09921c35a80552a2c7a59fb27f15537_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a09921c35a80552a2c7a59fb27f15537_b.jpg\"></figure><br><br>早在2016年的时候，cctv在facebook上就非常之火了，点赞超越了知名的美国有线电视新闻网cnn，粉丝数量也十分庞大。相对于枯燥的宣传和印象中官方账号的刻板，cctv凭借一个非常之机智又讨巧的方法赢得了fb民众的喜爱，那就是....<br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"145\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c255b896ee3f62ab717e5b6131b1d3ae_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"713\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"713\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c255b896ee3f62ab717e5b6131b1d3ae_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"145\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='713'%20height='145'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"713\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"713\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c255b896ee3f62ab717e5b6131b1d3ae_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c255b896ee3f62ab717e5b6131b1d3ae_b.jpg\"></figure><br>据说cctv利用可爱Q萌憨态可掬宇宙无敌巨卡哇伊的滚滚，吸引来了大批国内国外fb用户，每当发布大熊猫动态的时候，点赞量刷刷刷往上增，其他“正经”动态完全不可比拟。以至于受到吐槽和质疑<br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1845\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0df1963a286d8b4840a2994cee61d839_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0df1963a286d8b4840a2994cee61d839_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1845\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='1845'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0df1963a286d8b4840a2994cee61d839_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0df1963a286d8b4840a2994cee61d839_b.jpg\"></figure><br>滚滚首功 <br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1125\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e9292ea65497d0bbfa0be6cfbf4d5815_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1233\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1233\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e9292ea65497d0bbfa0be6cfbf4d5815_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1125\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1233'%20height='1125'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1233\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1233\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e9292ea65497d0bbfa0be6cfbf4d5815_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e9292ea65497d0bbfa0be6cfbf4d5815_b.jpg\"></figure><br><br>卖萌可耻，但是官方让我卖萌，就可爱咯 ♪(^∇^ )<br><br>现在一百度cctv facebook直接蹦出大熊猫...<br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1125\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c6bf49dfc4481fa378f28e9fd350b8d_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1240\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1240\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c6bf49dfc4481fa378f28e9fd350b8d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1125\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1240'%20height='1125'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1240\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1240\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c6bf49dfc4481fa378f28e9fd350b8d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c6bf49dfc4481fa378f28e9fd350b8d_b.jpg\"></figure>哈哈<br><br>每次发大熊猫的时候央视账号下面一群迷妹迷弟们，自己看上去有种嗯这就是我家的不错吧抱出来让你们看看赶快夸我家熊猫宝宝我骄傲我自豪！！<br><br>有一次cctv是发工作人员打扫大熊猫们的住处，然鹅熊猫们不乖总是来捣乱的视频，果然下面果然又是一群表白的 :<br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1841\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-7e8d165c567775d68ac7817086a70ff3_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-7e8d165c567775d68ac7817086a70ff3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1841\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='1841'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-7e8d165c567775d68ac7817086a70ff3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-7e8d165c567775d68ac7817086a70ff3_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1830\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a0013b18762959dfcad5644c6ae37f3a_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a0013b18762959dfcad5644c6ae37f3a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1830\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='1830'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a0013b18762959dfcad5644c6ae37f3a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a0013b18762959dfcad5644c6ae37f3a_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1863\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5cebbe01749182af4ca2fca31a1f1be_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5cebbe01749182af4ca2fca31a1f1be_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1863\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='1863'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5cebbe01749182af4ca2fca31a1f1be_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b5cebbe01749182af4ca2fca31a1f1be_b.jpg\"></figure><br><figure><noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1744\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-543b8d918ea65ea1ad099eac85203b54_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-543b8d918ea65ea1ad099eac85203b54_r.jpg\"></noscript><img data-rawheight=\"1744\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='1744'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-543b8d918ea65ea1ad099eac85203b54_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-543b8d918ea65ea1ad099eac85203b54_b.jpg\"></figure><br><br><br>可见一斑 ✧( •˓◞•̀ )", "praise_num": 3527, "comments_num": 120, "create_time": "2017-12-28T00:58:52", "update_time": "2017-12-28T01:09:20", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:12.083249"}
