2018-10-04 23:34:12 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 380912341, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/380912341", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "20d0bc8cc7437412317cd198ccebf76c", "content": "<p>是的。</p><p><br></p><p>唔，之前有个赞助商，健美方面的。<br>老板是个目测臂围50的肌肉佬。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>一行人来成都正事做完以后。大佬坚持要去都江堰看熊猫。。。</p><p><br></p><p>然后一路只要有熊猫出现的地方。全是这群肌肉佬的花式惊呼……<br>“oh ~~~so~so~Q……！！！”</p><p>“oh~~~~my gosh～”</p><p><br>“贴刻爱钠！”</p><p>“oh~!     Look at that nice little <br>Baby！！！！！”</p><p>…………</p><p>………………</p><p>其实人家熊猫只是在这里吃个东东挠挠屁股，或者翻个身而已。</p><p><br></p><p>嗯，。。。。<br>几个大佬大概画风是这样——<br>（用了祖师爷和卡特等一干大佬的合影。其实我那老板没那么大，只是拿来给外行感受一下氛围。）<br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-59efa5a821d1b6adbd780f28e91bc327_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"401\" data-rawheight=\"300\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"401\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='401'%20height='300'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"401\" data-rawheight=\"300\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"401\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-59efa5a821d1b6adbd780f28e91bc327_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>感觉老板他们见到熊猫过后，变成了————</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5ee82ba29be6b9d471e625f77269de88_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"900\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5ee82ba29be6b9d471e625f77269de88_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='900'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"900\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5ee82ba29be6b9d471e625f77269de88_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5ee82ba29be6b9d471e625f77269de88_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>嗯，对，就是反差萌。有种看到罗尼库尔曼撒娇的感觉。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br>法Q蛮！莱维！！！</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>——————更一下————————</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>为什么一堆号称四川人的会跑来跟我讲都江堰没有熊猫？？？你们真是四川土著吗 。不应该啊，大家都是同类的啊，智商情商都应该差不多啊 。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>差点让你们逼逼得我自己都以为，每次逢接待必去的这个地方。。。看到的熊猫。。。。。。。都是幻术！？！？！</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>逼逼之前自己先做好功课行吗，不然会显得你们自己没见过世面的。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5a6b07fd74876b875b0d3dc61e1745c7_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" data-rawheight=\"2208\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1f46dbf29e1e208eba63d8d89b371bb5_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5a6b07fd74876b875b0d3dc61e1745c7_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1242'%20height='2208'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1242\" data-rawheight=\"2208\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1f46dbf29e1e208eba63d8d89b371bb5_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1242\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5a6b07fd74876b875b0d3dc61e1745c7_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5a6b07fd74876b875b0d3dc61e1745c7_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cbac53b9007aecf33f5d3b15c3a378d2_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-680a8a3d4ef8cb8fb2e1931f7ab83ace_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cbac53b9007aecf33f5d3b15c3a378d2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1080'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-680a8a3d4ef8cb8fb2e1931f7ab83ace_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cbac53b9007aecf33f5d3b15c3a378d2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-cbac53b9007aecf33f5d3b15c3a378d2_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4ebf24faf0556b73e13c22e4a3428c89_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"3024\" data-rawheight=\"3024\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e5836272c68945a855f0c5ef862f86bb_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"3024\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4ebf24faf0556b73e13c22e4a3428c89_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='3024'%20height='3024'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"3024\" data-rawheight=\"3024\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e5836272c68945a855f0c5ef862f86bb_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"3024\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4ebf24faf0556b73e13c22e4a3428c89_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4ebf24faf0556b73e13c22e4a3428c89_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-548b8226df55603f909db94402d0e6df_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1920\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-05691bc6d6eefd7f108fe47c23e43898_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-548b8226df55603f909db94402d0e6df_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1080'%20height='1920'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1080\" data-rawheight=\"1920\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-05691bc6d6eefd7f108fe47c23e43898_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1080\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-548b8226df55603f909db94402d0e6df_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-548b8226df55603f909db94402d0e6df_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-79bd3f546c06a2fdc8bf51ad92efe9ab_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"3024\" data-rawheight=\"3024\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-94d15ec061a2fc7a3092830ab15a075f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"3024\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-79bd3f546c06a2fdc8bf51ad92efe9ab_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='3024'%20height='3024'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"3024\" data-rawheight=\"3024\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-94d15ec061a2fc7a3092830ab15a075f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"3024\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-79bd3f546c06a2fdc8bf51ad92efe9ab_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-79bd3f546c06a2fdc8bf51ad92efe9ab_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>BZW——熊猫谷的熊猫不算很多，但都是青壮年熊猫。比较活泼可爱，还有一只在吃奶的熊猫宝宝很萌。</p><p>另外大佬们表示很可爱的，就是那只靠在池子里思考人生的。</p>", "praise_num": 3217, "comments_num": 217, "create_time": "2018-05-01T22:48:10", "update_time": "2018-06-10T01:06:22", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:12.284079"}
