2018-10-04 23:34:26 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 472987604, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/472987604", "question_id": 290129514, "author_id": "f2ad1aca7b46c11b0babe609b788fd06", "content": "<p>果断提名《奥特曼》系列，之前的円谷还是想好好玩特摄，好好建立体系的。可奈克赛斯作为円谷向成人向靠拢的希望，却不为当时观众所认可，之后円谷就破产了。沉寂了好久直到被万代收购。然而万代爸爸是个玩具厂商，当然要买玩具啦！</p><p>有人调侃说 如今的奥特曼就是万代的玩具宣传片。</p><p><br></p><p>图多。。。侵删</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-435f1c22a70c6b73d14cc540920c6421_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"436\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c16594f855470a19b82b48951a62f32b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"700\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-435f1c22a70c6b73d14cc540920c6421_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='700'%20height='436'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"436\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c16594f855470a19b82b48951a62f32b_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"700\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-435f1c22a70c6b73d14cc540920c6421_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-435f1c22a70c6b73d14cc540920c6421_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d883436b43d45aab3bacb807eb86d907_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"700\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b20891367ec1a6dedca2936300141409_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"700\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d883436b43d45aab3bacb807eb86d907_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='700'%20height='700'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"700\" data-rawheight=\"700\" data-default-w