2018-10-04 23:34:33 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/494028359 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/494028359 [status:201 request:0.076s]
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 494028359, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494028359", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "d1d531f0cde6caae93073a847555aa91", "content": "<p>《道德经》不是说不努力，而是对人的要求非常高。</p><p>致虚极，守静笃，以观往复。</p><p>排除一切杂念，把你的时间腾出来，干什么呢？让自己虚空下来，不要装太多东西了，让自己安静下来，静到极致。</p><p>如果你觉得每件事都有道理，最终这些事都会浪费你的时间，对你的目标有干扰。</p><p>关于学习，人家很简单，就一句话，为学日益，这句话，就点明了学习的核心要素，不在乎你今天熬夜，明天头悬梁锥刺股，按照计划每天学一点，但是重点是你学的东西要学以致用，就是朝着你方向，和你方向无关的东西不要学了，这才是重点，所以呢，重点是方向是方法。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-18T20:19:21", "update_time": "2018-09-18T20:19:21", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:33.880745"}
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"494028359","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/questions/275029367/answers?include=data%5B%2A%5D.is_normal%2Cadmin_closed_comment%2Creward_info%2Cis_collapsed%2Cannotation_action%2Cannotation_detail%2Ccollapse_reason%2Cis_sticky%2Ccollapsed_by%2Csuggest_edit%2Ccomment_count%2Ccan_comment%2Ccontent%2Ceditable_content%2Cvoteup_count%2Creshipment_settings%2Ccomment_permission%2Ccreated_time%2Cupdated_time%2Creview_info%2Crelevant_info%2Cquestion%2Cexcerpt%2Crelationship.is_authorized%2Cis_author%2Cvoting%2Cis_thanked%2Cis_nothelp%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.mark_infos%5B%2A%5D.url%3Bdata%5B%2A%5D.author.follower_count%2Cbadge%5B%2A%5D.topics&limit=20&offset=180&sort_by=default%22>
{'author_id': 'd1d531f0cde6caae93073a847555aa91',
 'comments_num': 0,
 'content': '<p>《道德经》不是说不努力，而是对人的要求非常高。</p><p>致虚极，守静笃，以观往复。</p><p>排除一切杂念，把你的时间腾出来，干什么呢？让自己虚空下来，不要装太多东西了，让自己安静下来，静到极致。</p><p>如果你觉得每件事都有道理，最终这些事都会浪费你的时间，对你的目标有干扰。</p><p>关于学习，人家很简单，就一句话，为学日益，这句话，就点明了学习的核心要素，不在乎你今天熬夜，明天头悬梁锥刺股，按照计划每天学一点，但是重点是你学的东西要学以致用，就是朝着你方向，和你方向无关的东西不要学了，这才是重点，所以呢，重点是方向是方法。</p>',
 'crawl_time': datetime.datetime(2018, 10, 4, 23, 34, 33, 880745),
 'create_time': 1537273161,
 'praise_num': 0,
 'question_id': 275029367,
 'update_time': 1537273161,
 'url': 'https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/494028359',
 'zhihu_id': 494028359}
2018-10-04 23:34:33 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:34:34 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/493128336 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:34:34 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/493128336 [status:201 request:0.093s]
2018-10-04 23:34:34 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 493128336, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/493128336", "question_id": 275029367, "author_id": "fd22338711cd78d60bf9fc5f13dfd74c", "content": "<p>看到这个，我想插一句。。</p><p>古代的经典都是对单方面进行深入的理解，探讨。</p><p>并不是全方位来说。要不也不会有《永乐大典》《四库全书》</p><p>古时追求博览群书的重要性，不是只读几本。</p><p>《弟子规》中还有“余力学文”的说法呢。提出人们应该将行仪，言行，态度，还有我们居家生活当中所应该注意的事项都学好了，再用空暇的时间来充实自己，学习各方面知识。</p><p>但是，现在3岁幼儿园就开始学N个科目了。就没有学习将生活规范化，现在的生活中，只有在一些特定场合有礼仪，言行要求。在家里，谁能管得了谁？？？</p><p>并不能以《道德经》有没有某个概念就来评判，讨论这本书。</p><p>只能说，我们现在大多数人，读的书太少了。</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-09-17T13:39:18", "update_time": "2018-09-17T13:39:18", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:33.960205"}
2018-10-04 23:34:34 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"493128336","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
