2018-10-04 23:34:39 [urllib3.util.retry] DEBUG: Converted retries value: False -> Retry(total=False, connect=None, read=None, redirect=0, status=None)
2018-10-04 23:34:39 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/477315720 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:34:39 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/477315720 [status:201 request:0.098s]
2018-10-04 23:34:39 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 477315720, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/477315720", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "252ea350c38d907156035f7011844ed1", "content": "<p><a class=\"member_mention\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/2aa965a4bdc19e7075bf1cfd9d7cec40\" data-hash=\"2aa965a4bdc19e7075bf1cfd9d7cec40\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$2aa965a4bdc19e7075bf1cfd9d7cec40\">@蒼梧</a> 我觉得你说的有道理，但前提是日本把他们的发音给改了，起码要扩增啊。为什么英语借了拉丁语、希腊语、法语、德语等等词，没让人觉得难受？因为人家欧洲那么一大片语言，基本不是源于拉丁语就是日耳曼语，人家发音还多，大部分国家还都用拉丁字母，本来就差不多是一大家子，即使是西里尔字母也受到拉丁字母很深的影响。</p><p>你说你个日语，发音那么少，还不用拉丁字母，还非要往英语、法语这些语言上靠，何必呢？</p><p>既然文字能改，发音应该也能改吧？</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 2, "create_time": "2018-08-25T02:16:37", "update_time": "2018-08-25T02:16:37", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:39.403736"}
2018-10-04 23:34:39 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: < {"_index":"jobbole","_type":"zhihu_answer","_id":"477315720","_version":1,"result":"created","_shards":{"total":2,"successful":1,"failed":0},"created":true}
