            '<p><br></p><h2><b>可怕外來語的任務：</b></h2><figure><noscript><img '
            'src="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-68d7ee8f0da33991c721370d0f42c175_b.jpg" '
            'data-size="normal" data-rawwidth="823" data-rawheight="585" '
            'data-default-watermark-src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-354d849f9ac1bf989284ffbf84b41c68_b.jpg" '
            'class="origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb" width="823" '
            'data-original="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-68d7ee8f0da33991c721370d0f42c175_r.jpg"></noscript><img '
            'src="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%20width=\'823\'%20height=\'585\'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" '
            'data-size="normal" data-rawwidth="823" data-rawheight="585" '
            'data-default-watermark-src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-354d849f9ac1bf989284ffbf84b41c68_b.jpg" '
            'class="origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy" width="823" '
            'data-original="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-68d7ee8f0da33991c721370d0f42c175_r.jpg" '
            'data-actualsrc="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-68d7ee8f0da33991c721370d0f42c175_b.jpg"><figcaption>奧義累積超過4000傷害以上(沒有達成)</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img '
