2018-10-04 23:34:40 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 473222211, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/473222211", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "af648c3eb630c9a4898e312c7be9efd3", "content": "<p>因为本土的历史上找不到词来表示喽。</p><p>反正就觉得元素周期表的翻译是个强大的存在（感谢朱皇帝）</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-55e38492a69cbf3f5a2e0f9a3b484c5f_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1191\" data-rawheight=\"894\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3a094feb873e61af465e6298f4fe08cc_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1191\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-55e38492a69cbf3f5a2e0f9a3b484c5f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1191'%20height='894'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1191\" data-rawheight=\"894\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3a094feb873e61af465e6298f4fe08cc_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1191\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-55e38492a69cbf3f5a2e0f9a3b484c5f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-55e38492a69cbf3f5a2e0f9a3b484c5f_b.jpg\"></figure><p> 美国的</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c9e3c57db8f33e41dde6bde5a5f353e3_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"300\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4e6584aab05595313dce93f5bf78a30f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c9e3c57db8f33e41dde6bde5a5f353e3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='300'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"300\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4e6584aab05595313dce93f5bf78a30f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c9e3c57db8f33e41dde6bde5a5f353e3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c9e3c57db8f33e41dde6bde5a5f353e3_b.jpg\"></figure><p>日本的</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a37603a8f8f499781551a2f927717e44_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"547\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e4aa49397d3298042ed2e223af6d31a4_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a37603a8f8f499781551a2f927717e44_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='900'%20height='547'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"900\" data-rawheight=\"547\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e4aa49397d3298042ed2e223af6d31a4_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"900\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a37603a8f8f499781551a2f927717e44_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a37603a8f8f499781551a2f927717e44_b.jpg\"></figure><p>感觉中文厉害在看偏旁</p><p>能看出来哪个是金属元素，哪个是非金属元素。（有没有金字旁，除了汞，不过大多数人都知道是水银）</p><p>哪种单质在常温下是气态（氧），液态（溴，汞），固态（铝，硅）。</p><p>能帮助我们理解这些元素的性质</p><p>同时不管你认识不认识这个字你也有很大的可能能读出来，毕竟有形声的半边。</p><p><br></p><p>感觉日语版的想象无能。</p><p>gan jue ri yu ban xiang xiang wu neng zhe dao di shi ge shen me yang de dong dong.</p><p><br></p><p>youruyidachuanpinyin</p><p>犹如一大串拼音</p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-20T07:45:29", "update_time": "2018-08-26T01:46:38", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:39.930809"}
