2018-10-04 23:34:40 [urllib3.connectionpool] DEBUG: http://localhost:9200 "PUT /jobbole/zhihu_answer/457390788 HTTP/1.1" 201 156
2018-10-04 23:34:40 [elasticsearch] INFO: PUT http://localhost:9200/jobbole/zhihu_answer/457390788 [status:201 request:0.124s]
2018-10-04 23:34:40 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 457390788, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/457390788", "question_id": 264479217, "author_id": "4a407f6d9099c7bb483a4ad405436285", "content": "<p>引用网络语本身没什么负面的，瞎几把乱用才是负面的.....你说你日语里有的词也写片假是不是吃饱撑的。感觉很高级吗？有本事日常对话把日语翻译成英语再用片假读啊？哪个日本人跟我这样用片假词说话，我tm头都给他敲爆ಠ_ಠ </p>", "praise_num": 0, "comments_num": 0, "create_time": "2018-08-01T01:47:08", "update_time": "2018-08-01T01:47:08", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:40.828756"}
