script><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cf0b60c7925de4b5bfaa9734847cfdfc_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"312\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cf0b60c7925de4b5bfaa9734847cfdfc_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='450'%20height='312'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"312\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cf0b60c7925de4b5bfaa9734847cfdfc_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cf0b60c7925de4b5bfaa9734847cfdfc_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4c5b8b5153bbe325ec4edefdbd34473_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"191\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4c5b8b5153bbe325ec4edefdbd34473_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='450'%20height='191'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"191\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4c5b8b5153bbe325ec4edefdbd34473_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4c5b8b5153bbe325ec4edefdbd34473_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>现实中是这样子的：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-76fa8fce7ab5fa567b38e24811553dd2_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"487\" data-rawheight=\"328\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"487\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-76fa8fce7ab5fa567b38e24811553dd2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='487'%20height='328'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"487\" data-rawheight=\"328\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"487\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-76fa8fce7ab5fa567b38e24811553dd2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-76fa8fce7ab5fa567b38e24811553dd2_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-be0887c5d5080195df623b6e7b6dac95_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"615\" data-rawheight=\"445\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"615\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-be0887c5d5080195df623b6e7b6dac95_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='615'%20height='445'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"615\" data-rawheight=\"445\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"615\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-be0887c5d5080195df623b6e7b6dac95_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-be0887c5d5080195df623b6e7b6dac95_b.jpg\"></figure><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d055b96c840e4613b582bdf431702506_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"421\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d055b96c840e4613b582bdf431702506_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='421'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"421\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d055b96c840e4613b582bdf431702506_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-d055b96c840e4613b582bdf431702506_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>咳咳，终于看到更新啦。 ʕ◕౪◕ʔ </p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-317505ee84b41eebf95f3223690d75bc_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-317505ee84b41eebf95f3223690d75bc_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-317505ee84b41eebf95f3223690d75bc_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-317505ee84b41eebf95f3223690d75bc_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>胖胖乎乎，圆滚滚、黑白相间毛茸茸身体；动行动起来，慢慢悠悠走路还带八字步。一脸呆萌，憨态可掬。而且还像小孩子一样调皮，任性。活脱脱的淘气包，熊孩子。小编一个抠脚大汉都会被它们萌到，更何况其他的人？</p><p>这货存在的价值除了卖萌还是卖萌。在动物界论卖萌，熊猫若称第二，那其它动物很少敢称第一。是动物界当之无愧的“萌主”！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8111cfe2dc2c31a9f97ecf45e7ddabe5_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8111cfe2dc2c31a9f97ecf45e7ddabe5_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8111cfe2dc2c31a9f97ecf45e7ddabe5_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8111cfe2dc2c31a9f97ecf45e7ddabe5_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>圆乎乎的“滚滚”们，几乎所有人都没有免疫力。萌到不行！。</p><p>So.</p><p>我们来看一下世界各国对熊猫的痴狂,无论大熊猫走到哪里,就能立刻成为当地焦点的热门新闻。成为集千万宠爱于一身的明星。不信请看：</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-06f495d8586b7b829822a949cdd94a55_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-06f495d8586b7b829822a949cdd94a55_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='420'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-06f495d8586b7b829822a949cdd94a55_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-06f495d8586b7b829822a949cdd94a55_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>一、荷兰，花费巨资为大熊猫建造传统风格的中国“宫殿”<br>2017年年初郁金香之国荷兰为了迎接从中国租借来的一对大熊猫不惜耗巨资700万欧元（约合人民币5116万）建造一了座总面积达9000平方米中国传统风格的奢华宫殿，而熊猫的生活区就占了3400平方米。为了讨的熊猫的欢心，他们也真是费尽了心思，是千金为买一笑呀！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d96c972aa8fd77ab2ae91b940ee837af_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"552\" data-rawheight=\"342\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"552\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d96c972aa8fd77ab2ae91b940ee837af_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='552'%20height='342'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"552\" data-rawheight=\"342\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"552\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d96c972aa8fd77ab2ae91b940ee837af_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d96c972aa8fd77ab2ae91b940ee837af_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>二、英国,熊猫享受国宾待遇.有乐队和仪仗队夹道欢迎.</p><p>2011年12月4日，象征着中英两国友谊的大熊猫“甜甜”和“阳光”乘着专机联邦熊猫快递号从四川雅安大熊猫基地出发。飞往英格兰爱丁堡皇家动物园。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cce724447fb7bd8a0e1445de4fa208e8_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"241\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"390\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='390'%20height='241'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"241\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"390\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cce724447fb7bd8a0e1445de4fa208e8_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>当地的民众夹道迎接远道而来的\"贵宾\"那场面真是人山人海。真有普天同庆的味道。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3a1341551cbd711b732ddfb38abf92c3_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"405\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3a1341551cbd711b732ddfb38abf92c3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='405'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"405\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3a1341551cbd711b732ddfb38abf92c3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3a1341551cbd711b732ddfb38abf92c3_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>乐队相迎，简直就是大boss的待遇呀，利不利害！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-349bb8ff0b566e09d21d89af214a1904_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"312\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-349bb8ff0b566e09d21d89af214a1904_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='312'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"312\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-349bb8ff0b566e09d21d89af214a1904_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-349bb8ff0b566e09d21d89af214a1904_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>三、美国民众为大熊猫种竹子,冒着大雪为大熊猫送行。</p><p>熊猫除了会卖萌，还是吃货。一只熊猫一天能吃50多公斤竹子。美国佐治亚州的亚特兰大市的动物园，大熊猫的口粮而发愁。婺源专门雇了五个人来伺候，熊猫。婺源的竹子不够吃，动物园便动员当地的1000和民众提供竹子。民众也是心甘情愿的种植竹子。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4f930b30b02b7ebd4e456fb289e8b97_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"308\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4f930b30b02b7ebd4e456fb289e8b97_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='500'%20height='308'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"500\" data-rawheight=\"308\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"500\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4f930b30b02b7ebd4e456fb289e8b97_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e4f930b30b02b7ebd4e456fb289e8b97_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>2010年1月30日号在美国首都华盛顿的一家动物园，当地民冒着鹅毛大雪，送别即将返回中国的大熊猫“泰山”。因为租期到了，大熊猫要回自己的故乡中国了！</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a29f33962a24cfc6272cba2934f3acc_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"480\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"480\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a29f33962a24cfc6272cba2934f3acc_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='480'%20height='334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"480\" data-rawheight=\"334\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"480\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a29f33962a24cfc6272cba2934f3acc_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5a29f33962a24cfc6272cba2934f3acc_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>四、日本民众为大熊猫庆祝生日.为熊猫乐,为熊猫悲!</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5937411a4356c4f5b3ffb37a9560ce4d_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"550\" data-rawheight=\"384\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"550\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5937411a4356c4f5b3ffb37a9560ce4d_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='550'%20height='384'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"550\" data-rawheight=\"384\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"550\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5937411a4356c4f5b3ffb37a9560ce4d_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-5937411a4356c4f5b3ffb37a9560ce4d_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>街头可爱的小巴士。（我觉得夜里还是很吓人的啦）</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3d03fc68b7ade9be1dbd805455b37dda_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"577\" data-rawheight=\"265\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"577\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3d03fc68b7ade9be1dbd805455b37dda_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='577'%20height='265'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"577\" data-rawheight=\"265\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"577\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3d03fc68b7ade9be1dbd805455b37dda_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3d03fc68b7ade9be1dbd805455b37dda_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>街上广告。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f51db4c356c29fe2ae69b96259a069a0_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"554\" data-rawheight=\"624\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"554\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f51db4c356c29fe2ae69b96259a069a0_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='554'%20height='624'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"554\" data-rawheight=\"624\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"554\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f51db4c356c29fe2ae69b96259a069a0_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f51db4c356c29fe2ae69b96259a069a0_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>2002年日本东京的上野动物园。大熊猫“珍珍”产下了一只熊猫宝宝。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3ca14def2ebfc0d2e2c54c42c8e7bdfd_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"378\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3ca14def2ebfc0d2e2c54c42c8e7bdfd_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='378'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"378\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3ca14def2ebfc0d2e2c54c42c8e7bdfd_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3ca14def2ebfc0d2e2c54c42c8e7bdfd_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>动物园和当地民众得知这一喜讯，非常兴奋。纷纷为熊猫宝宝举行各种形式的庆祝活动。但世事难料，不到一周。熊猫幼崽就不幸夭折。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c55db3680ffd9a7957914b05989d8f41_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"774\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c55db3680ffd9a7957914b05989d8f41_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='774'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"774\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c55db3680ffd9a7957914b05989d8f41_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-c55db3680ffd9a7957914b05989d8f41_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>因为此事日本上野动物园园长，更是在新闻直播中，痛哭流涕道歉。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-932ee06cc1ac4d58e88908695419a9c6_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"294\" data-rawheight=\"321\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"294\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='294'%20height='321'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"294\" data-rawheight=\"321\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"294\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-932ee06cc1ac4d58e88908695419a9c6_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>小朋友也很伤心呢。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-695c6e90da1dd9f395b780400d7d4b12_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"318\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-695c6e90da1dd9f395b780400d7d4b12_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='450'%20height='318'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"450\" data-rawheight=\"318\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"450\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-695c6e90da1dd9f395b780400d7d4b12_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-695c6e90da1dd9f395b780400d7d4b12_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>人们为不幸夭折熊猫宝宝献上鲜花。</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c6b441fb9c0a3b563b748c5d90cbb356_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"260\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"390\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='390'%20height='260'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"390\" data-rawheight=\"260\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"390\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c6b441fb9c0a3b563b748c5d90cbb356_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>五、2012年1月15日，中国租借给法国两只大熊猫“欢欢”和“圆仔”搭乘专机飞抵巴黎。法国为了争取这对大熊猫赴法，此前已与中国展开了两年的外交谈判和对话。</p><p>15日一早，就已经有两三百名记者守候在巴黎戴高乐国际机场，法国媒体纷纷将“欢欢”和“圆仔”誉为VIP贵宾。<br>以上足以看出中国大熊猫非凡的魅力。看在熊猫的份上，不给个赞？</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2979f3e0b4ac8ba377d1c8ad10779367_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"550\" data-rawheight=\"377\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"550\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2979f3e0b4ac8ba377d1c8ad10779367_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='550'%20height='377'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"550\" data-rawheight=\"377\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"550\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2979f3e0b4ac8ba377d1c8ad10779367_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2979f3e0b4ac8ba377d1c8ad10779367_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>博瓦尔动物园因为欢欢和圆仔的到来超越了历史悠久的香波堡，成为法国卢瓦尔-谢尔省接纳游客最多的旅游目的地。熊猫到来当年，博瓦尔动物园游客人数增长60%，超过了100万人次。不仅如此，动物园每年要进十个集装箱的中国制造的毛绒玩具。两只熊猫几乎是单靠自身就制造了一种经济模式。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8935b6f3c4079c72b3455614c5200f89_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"540\" data-rawheight=\"396\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"540\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8935b6f3c4079c72b3455614c5200f89_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='540'%20height='396'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"540\" data-rawheight=\"396\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"540\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8935b6f3c4079c72b3455614c5200f89_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8935b6f3c4079c72b3455614c5200f89_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>六、加拿大</p><p>2013年3月25日，大熊猫大毛、二顺“伉俪”乘坐专机抵达多伦多皮尔逊国际机场。跟英国的大熊猫类似，加拿大前总理哈珀亲到机场迎接。</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82857cbf64afabb2d837536f6708bf18_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"579\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"579\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82857cbf64afabb2d837536f6708bf18_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='579'%20height='420'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"579\" data-rawheight=\"420\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"579\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82857cbf64afabb2d837536f6708bf18_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82857cbf64afabb2d837536f6708bf18_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>在大熊猫公开亮相时，多伦多市长福特带着妻子、子女参加仪式，并将大熊猫抵加称为“历史性事件”。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8faeeec86413b20a221f240af20a1c3f_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"469\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8faeeec86413b20a221f240af20a1c3f_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='469'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"469\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8faeeec86413b20a221f240af20a1c3f_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8faeeec86413b20a221f240af20a1c3f_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p>总理与熊猫。<br>但比英国那两只大熊猫省心的是，“二顺”去年10月就在多伦多生下了熊猫宝宝，还是双胞胎！多伦多动物园又称之为“历史性的时刻”。</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-13820e46a88fdcb719cc580a6ecf6d36_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"475\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-13820e46a88fdcb719cc580a6ecf6d36_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='600'%20height='475'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"600\" data-rawheight=\"475\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"600\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-13820e46a88fdcb719cc580a6ecf6d36_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-13820e46a88fdcb719cc580a6ecf6d36_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>两只小家伙刚刚长大一点，动物园就开始在网上广泛征集创意，给它们起名字。最后，人们决定给这两只熊猫起名为“加盼盼”和“加悦悦”，还搞了一个超级隆重的命名仪式，加拿大总理本人亲自出席……</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f70b9517903cdbb24da6339dcce9f4b8_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"594\" data-rawheight=\"81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"594\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f70b9517903cdbb24da6339dcce9f4b8_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='594'%20height='81'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"594\" data-rawheight=\"81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"594\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f70b9517903cdbb24da6339dcce9f4b8_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f70b9517903cdbb24da6339dcce9f4b8_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>粉丝们也瞬间化身迷妹，一开始大家的关注点还在总理身上，但是后来，所有的焦点都被两只熊猫宝宝抢走了……</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-87270b81471e5606f09dcb119c2e813b_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"385\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-87270b81471e5606f09dcb119c2e813b_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='385'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"385\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-87270b81471e5606f09dcb119c2e813b_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-87270b81471e5606f09dcb119c2e813b_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>再说说美国。</p><p>2013年联邦政府关门风波，很多美国人最难过的不是公务员无薪休假，不是国家公园、博物馆各种关门，也不是两党扯皮，而是华盛顿动物园的熊猫24小时直播停工。</p><p>许多熊猫铁杆粉丝因无法围观熊猫一天的生活表示极为不满，幸福指数迅速下降。媒体见民怨赶紧发文安慰，表示虽然关门熊猫仍会被很好地照顾。</p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3d24e65574ed0d47c41dbb61090456a9_b.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"853\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3d24e65574ed0d47c41dbb61090456a9_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='640'%20height='853'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"640\" data-rawheight=\"853\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"640\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3d24e65574ed0d47c41dbb61090456a9_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3d24e65574ed0d47c41dbb61090456a9_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>甚至还有网友讲述了在美国这样的故事：</p><p>暑假学校有夏令营，就是去美国寄宿家庭住半个月体验生活的那种。 刚到的时候挺紧张的，寒暄了几句，女主人问我来自中国哪里，我说四川。一家人沉默了一下，说只知道北京和香港。我又说有火锅啥啥的，妄图以食物打败对方。</p><p>他们说吃过[虽然后来他们带我们去吃是那种下面加电热炉的，根本不是我大四川的火锅哼]，突然我灵机一动，说四川有好多熊猫。这女主人突然就大叫起来，把她在家的几个娃都喊到客厅来[没错，她家有六个娃，有三个男孩是三胞胎]，一边叫一边喊：她来自熊猫的故乡！！！你们快过来！！！然后这家子人就疯魔了。拉住我问长问短，说家里有好多好多熊猫公仔，小孩小时候睡觉都是抱着睡好想看看真的呜呜。。。</p><p>blahblah。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>【图文收集于网络，侵删】</p><p>先这样吧，走前不给个赞？为了答题，我已成熊猫眼。。。</p><p><br></p><p>我的其他'的一些回答：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/68014919/answer/424123350\" class=\"internal\">你见过最杠的杠精是什么样的？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/21567651/answer/421906809\" class=\"internal\">为什么说俄罗斯是战斗民族？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/26391310/answer/428856629?group_id=996439390595514368#comment-476664818\" class=\"internal\">女生一个人去印度自由行一个月左右可行吗？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/53770251/answer/374126166?group_id=996347908316348416#comment-437714803\" class=\"internal\">有没有和龙应台在港大演讲时台下齐唱《我的祖国》相似的事件？</a></p>", "praise_num": 2426, "comments_num": 75, "create_time": "2018-01-16T03:31:06", "update_time": "2018-06-30T19:49:21", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:41.471437"}
