ght=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4d3740b6954d77002e0338e338ff26b1_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b8461868e1866237c923319abfd2b915_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='960'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-4d3740b6954d77002e0338e338ff26b1_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b8461868e1866237c923319abfd2b915_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b8461868e1866237c923319abfd2b915_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f2636b6c1167e7517e815db35012b7e2_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-282d5a12e37d4bca34f16c098a351b93_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f2636b6c1167e7517e815db35012b7e2_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='960'%20height='1280'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-282d5a12e37d4bca34f16c098a351b93_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f2636b6c1167e7517e815db35012b7e2_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f2636b6c1167e7517e815db35012b7e2_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c8adee90eeef4f75c5937787169f4cc4_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e3433381ca8a58cdd530078b4325efd_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c8adee90eeef4f75c5937787169f4cc4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1280'%20height='960'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"960\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8e3433381ca8a58cdd530078b4325efd_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c8adee90eeef4f75c5937787169f4cc4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c8adee90eeef4f75c5937787169f4cc4_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f28cdb750bc1359f4371d425208cbfc_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc1a6e2ac89f7bb38748120ad213f22f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f28cdb750bc1359f4371d425208cbfc_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='960'%20height='1280'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"960\" data-rawheight=\"1280\" data-size=\"normal\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-fc1a6e2ac89f7bb38748120ad213f22f_b.jpg\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"960\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f28cdb750bc1359f4371d425208cbfc_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f28cdb750bc1359f4371d425208cbfc_b.jpg\"></figure><p>小时候连拉粑粑都辣么可爱</p><p>------分割线-----</p><p><br></p><p>以前在青年旅舍工作，养了一只边牧，在他还是边牧宝宝的时候，某天～</p><p>我抱着狗子下楼梯，两个外国小哥正上楼，然后一声惊呼“啊，胖哒！是胖哒啊！！！她抱着一只胖哒啊！！！！”</p><p>于是把我堵在楼梯口，一脸小心翼翼的问可不可以抱抱？</p><p>我说可以，但这不是胖哒，是狗～</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-62fe24179637e4a68be953e4e4824ae3_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"683\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-62fe24179637e4a68be953e4e4824ae3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='683'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1024\" data-rawheight=\"683\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1024\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-62fe24179637e4a68be953e4e4824ae3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-62fe24179637e4a68be953e4e4824ae3_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7085e421d29844a591781c69c38a97ec_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1632\" data-rawheight=\"1224\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1632\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7085e421d29844a591781c69c38a97ec_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1632'%20height='1224'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1632\" data-rawheight=\"1224\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1632\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7085e421d29844a591781c69c38a97ec_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7085e421d29844a591781c69c38a97ec_b.jpg\"></figure>", "praise_num": 1481, "comments_num": 84, "create_time": "2018-04-17T11:47:46", "update_time": "2018-05-29T13:50:30", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:42.276618"}
