2018-10-04 23:34:42 [elasticsearch] DEBUG: > {"zhihu_id": 298209869, "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/answers/298209869", "question_id": 21645954, "author_id": "d88eda76b70f4dc04e7509c9320c700c", "content": "<p>——看到评论区有妹子想看视频 就从FB载下来了  （图片已更为视频，尽情点吧！）</p><p>P.S.现在FB很多国外网红贴来自秒拍 虽然也不知道他们怎么弄的..  </p><p>视频实在不知出处就转载了 见谅！ </p><p><br></p><p>——就刚看到的 给大家更个新的好玩的 </p><p>有个FB好友分享了一只吃胡萝卜的滚滚（那视频竟然还是秒拍哪里给偷来的） 大意在说 非常讨厌咀嚼很大声的行为 但是愿意看一百万次滚滚大声吃胡萝卜 十几秒差不多2500万浏览量...没别的 就是在啃胡萝卜 </p><p>评论都是一大片对着滚滚吃胡萝卜犯花痴  一片爱心海 </p><a class=\"video-box\" href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.zhihu.com/video/983036205948137472\" target=\"_blank\" data-video-id=\"\" data-video-playable=\"\" data-name=\"\" data-poster=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9699d6316edb7ddeb1953161a56cb671.png\" data-lens-id=\"983036205948137472\">              <img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9699d6316edb7ddeb1953161a56cb671.png\">              <span class=\"content\">                <span class=\"title\"><span class=\"z-ico-extern-gray\"></span><span class=\"z-ico-extern-blue\"></span></span>                <span class=\"url\"><span class=\"z-ico-video\"></span>https://www.zhihu.com/video/983036205948137472</span>              </span>            </a>            <p>—————-原</p><p>（多图预警）<br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-813957866575f74b1b3b39cb249fd4c3_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-813957866575f74b1b3b39cb249fd4c3_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-813957866575f74b1b3b39cb249fd4c3_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-813957866575f74b1b3b39cb249fd4c3_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>此为FB上一个滚滚专页 只po滚滚</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d83f01a203d3969fb2fb33326acc5c4_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d83f01a203d3969fb2fb33326acc5c4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d83f01a203d3969fb2fb33326acc5c4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d83f01a203d3969fb2fb33326acc5c4_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>没错这是粉丝数 </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c3270cc5ba95dadc866188e8acee6722_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c3270cc5ba95dadc866188e8acee6722_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c3270cc5ba95dadc866188e8acee6722_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c3270cc5ba95dadc866188e8acee6722_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>注意浏览量 </p><p>——-分割线后为各国评论随截</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5c14057c162d74fef268498ea7f77eb4_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5c14057c162d74fef268498ea7f77eb4_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5c14057c162d74fef268498ea7f77eb4_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5c14057c162d74fef268498ea7f77eb4_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>“太棒啦我就是喜欢它   ”<br>“我们将来某一天去成都当一天熊猫饲养员怎么样？” </p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7a1adc314009a4057b0f045c26270a0a_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7a1adc314009a4057b0f045c26270a0a_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7a1adc314009a4057b0f045c26270a0a_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-7a1adc314009a4057b0f045c26270a0a_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>“你为什么辣么么么么可爱？！！”<br>“滚滚你为什么那么可爱？”</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-618256e45231d31bfd56b541ec017df9_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-618256e45231d31bfd56b541ec017df9_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-618256e45231d31bfd56b541ec017df9_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-618256e45231d31bfd56b541ec017df9_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>“世上怎么能有熊猫这种这么美好的东西？”<br>“这就是你为什么得关注这个主页，它让所有事情都变得美好起来”</p><p><br></p><figure><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5c0026181c0ae0fb586a12854a84b08_b.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5c0026181c0ae0fb586a12854a84b08_r.jpg\"></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='750'%20height='1334'&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"1334\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5c0026181c0ae0fb586a12854a84b08_r.jpg\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5c0026181c0ae0fb586a12854a84b08_b.jpg\"></figure><p><br>（这里前一秒有人只是说视频里的滚滚蠢萌 然后立马引来反对...妈呀 这是有多爱啊）<br>“快看他那蠢蠢的脸”<br>“你认为你把这么个小可怜说成蠢蠢的脸感觉很好吗？”<br>“他是一个baby...瞧瞧你自己那愚蠢的脸”</p><p><br>——-— 分割线<br>还有好多好多好多好多好多 想看的可以关注这个主页（好像微博也有） 或者我可以再去截好玩的给你们 <br>不过我想这足以证明这个问题的答案了吧</p>", "praise_num": 1368, "comments_num": 101, "create_time": "2018-01-18T10:45:39", "update_time": "2018-05-24T17:47:20", "crawl_time": "2018-10-04T23:34:42.453578"}
